(806792, 90514, 19425, '<td valign="top">You know, i loved this shot, but i cant stop looking at the halo looking effect around the couple. I can''t tell if its my eyes or some sorta over blurring and then sharpening or what.....all in all though, it really does capture the emotion.</td>', 'You know, i loved this shot, but i cant stop looking at the halo looking effect around the couple. I can''t tell if its my eyes or some sorta over blurring and then sharpening or what.....all in all though, it really does capture the emotion.', '2004-07-12 01:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(806795, 90548, 22046, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. I bet you get a bunch of angry comments. Personally I think you are right on the money. Whether you agree with what Michael Moore says or not what freedom is about is his ability to say what he has to say, critical of our president or not. That is the freedom we all enjoy. Photographically I consider this to be right in the middle - 5 for the photo, 7 for the idea = 6.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. I bet you get a bunch of angry comments. Personally I think you are right on the money. Whether you agree with what Michael Moore says or not what freedom is about is his ability to say what he has to say, critical of our president or not. That is the freedom we all enjoy. Photographically I consider this to be right in the middle - 5 for the photo, 7 for the idea = 6.', '2004-07-12 01:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(806796, 90248, 22046, '<td valign="top">Your title says it and transforms this simple sky into a statement of "the American Dream" based on freedom.</td>', 'Your title says it and transforms this simple sky into a statement of "the American Dream" based on freedom.', '2004-07-12 01:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(806797, 90563, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting combination of colors... nice antique feel...  The composition feels a bit odd with no ''grounding''... having the door cut off at the bottom without a base just creates a bit of visual discomfort for me.  I think a straight-on composition of the front of the yellow/green building would be strong by itself.. including the ''grounding'' i mentioned before.   Excellent idea for this challenge :)</td>', 'Interesting combination of colors... nice antique feel...  The composition feels a bit odd with no ''grounding''... having the door cut off at the bottom without a base just creates a bit of visual discomfort for me.  I think a straight-on composition of the front of the yellow/green building would be strong by itself.. including the ''grounding'' i mentioned before.   Excellent idea for this challenge :)', '2004-07-12 01:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(806798, 90245, 22046, '<td valign="top">More peace than freedom to me since they are white doves. A pretty picture though.</td>', 'More peace than freedom to me since they are white doves. A pretty picture though.', '2004-07-12 01:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
