(806966, 90568, 19952, '<td valign="top">Fun shot with great action and expressions. It seems like the photo is a bit undersaturated, so you might want to boost that a little. Still, nice photo of an excellent subject.</td>', 'Fun shot with great action and expressions. It seems like the photo is a bit undersaturated, so you might want to boost that a little. Still, nice photo of an excellent subject.', '2004-07-12 04:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(806970, 90199, 19952, '<td valign="top">Nice bright colors and a good silhouette. It seems like the clouds are a bit overprocessed, which makes them seem sort of artificial. But it''s still a good photo of a nice sunset.</td>', 'Nice bright colors and a good silhouette. It seems like the clouds are a bit overprocessed, which makes them seem sort of artificial. But it''s still a good photo of a nice sunset.', '2004-07-12 04:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
