(806977, 89973, 19952, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a great capture. I think a bit more contrast might make the eagle stand out even more, but tis is a very nice shot as it is. Great job!</td>', 'Wow, what a great capture. I think a bit more contrast might make the eagle stand out even more, but tis is a very nice shot as it is. Great job!', '2004-07-12 04:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
