(806979, 90124, 19952, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a dramatic image. I''m really curious to find out what was going on here.</td>', 'Wow, what a dramatic image. I''m really curious to find out what was going on here.', '2004-07-12 04:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
