(807012, 90403, 17233, '<td valign="top">You have more guts than me - I wouldn''t be caught dead taking photos of a prison at odd hours :). Nicely composed however and I like the diminishing scale of the towers. Even the negative space in the upper left works for me. Could do with just a little more contrast and be a little sharper. Well done (7)</td>', 'You have more guts than me - I wouldn''t be caught dead taking photos of a prison at odd hours :). Nicely composed however and I like the diminishing scale of the towers. Even the negative space in the upper left works for me. Could do with just a little more contrast and be a little sharper. Well done (7)', '2004-07-12 06:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
