(807040, 90516, 19952, '<td valign="top">I like the soft effect you applied to this shot. I think it might work even better if you brightened the original a bit and boosted the saturation before blurring. Still, nice shot.</td>', 'I like the soft effect you applied to this shot. I think it might work even better if you brightened the original a bit and boosted the saturation before blurring. Still, nice shot.', '2004-07-12 07:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(807087, 90488, 19952, '<td valign="top">Trying out a new lens? :-) I like this shot and love the subject, but I do think it would be better without the fisheye. Still, this is a nice interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Trying out a new lens? :-) I like this shot and love the subject, but I do think it would be better without the fisheye. Still, this is a nice interpretation of the challenge.', '2004-07-12 09:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(807089, 89168, 7322, '<td valign="top">This would make more sense if the headstone showed a soldier who died in a war. I''m not saying thi man did not make sacrifices but the title and photograph imply the cost of freedom is sometimes death and this man obviously lived quite a long time after serving in those wars. <br/> <br/>Photographically, it is a nice documentary photo of the cemetary.</td>', 'This would make more sense if the headstone showed a soldier who died in a war. I''m not saying thi man did not make sacrifices but the title and photograph imply the cost of freedom is sometimes death and this man obviously lived quite a long time after serving in those wars.  Photographically, it is a nice documentary photo of the cemetary.', '2004-07-12 09:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(807091, 90357, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is  kind of dull subject matter. The surroundings are nice but not particulalry inspirational. The scene is a bit contrasty.</td>', 'This is  kind of dull subject matter. The surroundings are nice but not particulalry inspirational. The scene is a bit contrasty.', '2004-07-12 09:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
