(807093, 90581, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t get how freedom is represented by a close-up of an eye. <br/> <br/>Photographically,it is okay, althugh I''ve seen a lot of eye close-ups on DPC in the past three months. It is interesting that the background echose the color of the eye.</td>', 'I don''t get how freedom is represented by a close-up of an eye.  Photographically,it is okay, althugh I''ve seen a lot of eye close-ups on DPC in the past three months. It is interesting that the background echose the color of the eye.', '2004-07-12 09:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(807094, 90181, 7322, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a particularly inspirational tree. It looks rather scrubby, especially in comparison to the trees in the background. This isn''t a great composition. It would be more effective if somehow the tree was actually isolated as the only one object in the shot.</td>', 'This isn''t a particularly inspirational tree. It looks rather scrubby, especially in comparison to the trees in the background. This isn''t a great composition. It would be more effective if somehow the tree was actually isolated as the only one object in the shot.', '2004-07-12 09:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(807095, 90377, 7322, '<td valign="top">That''s a rather disturbing statue. It looks like it is urinating. Weird. The statue is quite dark and lacking detail (if there were more detail I would probably see a definitive source of the water which would make this look less odd). The exposure seems a bit blurry or perhaps it is just noise. Some adjustments to the tone of the black and white are in order. This is just bland.</td>', 'That''s a rather disturbing statue. It looks like it is urinating. Weird. The statue is quite dark and lacking detail (if there were more detail I would probably see a definitive source of the water which would make this look less odd). The exposure seems a bit blurry or perhaps it is just noise. Some adjustments to the tone of the black and white are in order. This is just bland.', '2004-07-12 09:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(807096, 90514, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a bit too softfocus. It looks overprocessed to me.</td>', 'This is a bit too softfocus. It looks overprocessed to me.', '2004-07-12 09:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(807098, 90352, 7322, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a particulalry inspirational set-up. It doesn''t grab my interest at all. The focus appears rather soft and lacking detail. The vertical crinkle in the wall is distracting.</td>', 'This isn''t a particulalry inspirational set-up. It doesn''t grab my interest at all. The focus appears rather soft and lacking detail. The vertical crinkle in the wall is distracting.', '2004-07-12 09:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(807100, 90152, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice cleavage but not much else of interest in this shot. Sorry.</td>', 'Nice cleavage but not much else of interest in this shot. Sorry.', '2004-07-12 09:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(807101, 90410, 7322, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark but I like the quality of this. I wish there was a bit more separation of the pigeon from the dark background.</td>', 'A bit too dark but I like the quality of this. I wish there was a bit more separation of the pigeon from the dark background.', '2004-07-12 09:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(807102, 90361, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting location but I don''t see the connection to freedom. Perhaps if the title were a bit more descriptive? <br/> <br/>It''s rather high contrast. Some lightening around the stairs would add a bit of drama.</td>', 'This is an interesting location but I don''t see the connection to freedom. Perhaps if the title were a bit more descriptive?  It''s rather high contrast. Some lightening around the stairs would add a bit of drama.', '2004-07-12 09:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(807103, 90488, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is too contrasty. There is very little separation between the dark bike and the dark background. It needs some middle values.</td>', 'This is too contrasty. There is very little separation between the dark bike and the dark background. It needs some middle values.', '2004-07-12 09:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(807105, 90199, 7322, '<td valign="top">The silhouettes are a bit too closely cropped. The heads look gigantic and I don''t get a feeling of space.</td>', 'The silhouettes are a bit too closely cropped. The heads look gigantic and I don''t get a feeling of space.', '2004-07-12 09:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(807106, 90582, 7322, '<td valign="top">It would be more interesting if the stage weren''t empty. This is just kind of random crowd scene and the crowd isn''t doing anything interesting.</td>', 'It would be more interesting if the stage weren''t empty. This is just kind of random crowd scene and the crowd isn''t doing anything interesting.', '2004-07-12 09:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(807111, 90284, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see this as freedom.  Setting aside the fact that it is an inanimate object (of sorts, a  rain drop has no choice but to fall eventually. Its only option is down. That isn''t freedom---it''s the law of gravity. <br/> <br/>This is a nice shot, though. I like the use of complementary colors and the composition is quite active and engaging. If it had met the challenge, it would be a 7. Not meeting the challenge, I have to rate it lower. <br/></td>', 'I don''t really see this as freedom.  Setting aside the fact that it is an inanimate object (of sorts, a  rain drop has no choice but to fall eventually. Its only option is down. That isn''t freedom---it''s the law of gravity.  This is a nice shot, though. I like the use of complementary colors and the composition is quite active and engaging. If it had met the challenge, it would be a 7. Not meeting the challenge, I have to rate it lower. ', '2004-07-12 09:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(807114, 90213, 7322, '<td valign="top">I know this seems a bit nitpicky, but honestly, too me she looks caged in by the ugly rails . The bare concrete wall adds to the feeling of confinement. It has a prison-like quality. <br/> <br/>I do like the softness of the colors in the grass and the vista.</td>', 'I know this seems a bit nitpicky, but honestly, too me she looks caged in by the ugly rails . The bare concrete wall adds to the feeling of confinement. It has a prison-like quality.  I do like the softness of the colors in the grass and the vista.', '2004-07-12 09:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(807115, 90548, 7322, '<td valign="top">Kind of stretch and not very compelling subject matter.</td>', 'Kind of stretch and not very compelling subject matter.', '2004-07-12 10:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
