(807132, 90551, 18191, '<td valign="top">The sun is too overpowering here. The sunburst is not my favorite effect in a photo and I usually trry to exclude the flare, it takes a little too much away from the subject.</td>', 'The sun is too overpowering here. The sunburst is not my favorite effect in a photo and I usually trry to exclude the flare, it takes a little too much away from the subject.', '2004-07-12 10:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
