(807755, 90199, 18517, '<td valign="top">The bottom 1/3rd of this image is too dark or too negative. This photo probably would have balanced better if the horizon was further down. There''s levels monkeying evident in the clouds, as shown by the stark outlines of color where there should be gradients instead. Easing up on it won''t ruin your photo. We know what color the sky is. 6</td>', 'The bottom 1/3rd of this image is too dark or too negative. This photo probably would have balanced better if the horizon was further down. There''s levels monkeying evident in the clouds, as shown by the stark outlines of color where there should be gradients instead. Easing up on it won''t ruin your photo. We know what color the sky is. 6', '2004-07-12 18:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(807758, 90575, 18517, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. It''d be better if you could see the subject''s face.</td>', 'Very nice capture. It''d be better if you could see the subject''s face.', '2004-07-12 18:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
