(807771, 90155, 18517, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. The balance feels off here. I want to push the frame up about 2 inches. The colors of the flowers work good against the background, but the bird blends in a little too well. It''s also a tad soft.</td>', 'Nice capture. The balance feels off here. I want to push the frame up about 2 inches. The colors of the flowers work good against the background, but the bird blends in a little too well. It''s also a tad soft.', '2004-07-12 19:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
