(807989, 90416, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and subject. I think a more dramatic sky via levels adjustment in p-shop would have increased the overall impact. Nice shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Nice composition and subject. I think a more dramatic sky via levels adjustment in p-shop would have increased the overall impact. Nice shot nonetheless.', '2004-07-12 21:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(807994, 90426, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great feeling of freedom from this shot. I think I would have liked to see it more exposed and with the blues not so heavily saturate. But that''s just personal opinion and the shot still works beautifully.</td>', 'Great feeling of freedom from this shot. I think I would have liked to see it more exposed and with the blues not so heavily saturate. But that''s just personal opinion and the shot still works beautifully.', '2004-07-12 21:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(807998, 90207, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution. The DOF and focus on the hands really emphasizes the subject.</td>', 'Great idea and execution. The DOF and focus on the hands really emphasizes the subject.', '2004-07-12 21:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(808000, 89973, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and POV. You really managed to capture your subject in the perfect poise. I think a little more deeply saturated sky may have improved it, but still a great shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Nice composition and POV. You really managed to capture your subject in the perfect poise. I think a little more deeply saturated sky may have improved it, but still a great shot nonetheless.', '2004-07-12 21:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(808002, 90217, 20235, '<td valign="top">I like the darkness of the trees and grass in this shot as it helps to emphasize the grave stones more. Composition and the way the eye is drawn throughout the photo is nice. The colors seem a little washed out, or more heavily weighted in the red spectrum. but I''m sure that''s just a result of the time of day.</td>', 'I like the darkness of the trees and grass in this shot as it helps to emphasize the grave stones more. Composition and the way the eye is drawn throughout the photo is nice. The colors seem a little washed out, or more heavily weighted in the red spectrum. but I''m sure that''s just a result of the time of day.', '2004-07-12 21:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(808004, 89830, 19425, '<td valign="top">Love your choice of color</td>', 'Love your choice of color', '2004-07-12 21:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(808009, 90430, 20235, '<td valign="top">I like your idea here. The only thing thay distracts me is the foliage in the foreground and the busy treeline in the back. It creates a somewhat clausterphobic feel that is contrary to the idea. If this shot was in a wide open field or had an element of sky in the background the notion of "free roaming" would have been better emphasized. Having said that, you obviously have no control over where the cows are positioned, so nice shot nonetheless.</td>', 'I like your idea here. The only thing thay distracts me is the foliage in the foreground and the busy treeline in the back. It creates a somewhat clausterphobic feel that is contrary to the idea. If this shot was in a wide open field or had an element of sky in the background the notion of "free roaming" would have been better emphasized. Having said that, you obviously have no control over where the cows are positioned, so nice shot nonetheless.', '2004-07-12 21:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(808012, 90161, 20235, '<td valign="top">I like the color palette and tones in this shot. Along with the metal cuffs, they create a juxtoposition with the theme and butterfly pattern. Great job.</td>', 'I like the color palette and tones in this shot. Along with the metal cuffs, they create a juxtoposition with the theme and butterfly pattern. Great job.', '2004-07-12 21:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(808018, 90002, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Your focus and POV is nice. The cropping is a little tight imho and the shot may have been more representative of freedom without the birds wings being clipped (sorry for the pun).</td>', 'Great capture. Your focus and POV is nice. The cropping is a little tight imho and the shot may have been more representative of freedom without the birds wings being clipped (sorry for the pun).', '2004-07-12 21:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(808021, 90483, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great idea and framing in this shot. The composition with the balloon being in the corner really emphasizes freedom. Focus seems a little off though, and there seems to be a little noise evident, particularly in the sky. Great shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Great idea and framing in this shot. The composition with the balloon being in the corner really emphasizes freedom. Focus seems a little off though, and there seems to be a little noise evident, particularly in the sky. Great shot nonetheless.', '2004-07-12 21:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(808023, 90569, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution. I like the detail on the ring and shallow DOF used. This shot really tells a story and eludes to the theme of freedom. Nice work.</td>', 'Great idea and execution. I like the detail on the ring and shallow DOF used. This shot really tells a story and eludes to the theme of freedom. Nice work.', '2004-07-12 21:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(808024, 90199, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great colors and tone in this shot. It really has an emotive quality. I would have liked to see the sky comprise more of the composition with the dark bottom cropped out. But still a great photo.</td>', 'Great colors and tone in this shot. It really has an emotive quality. I would have liked to see the sky comprise more of the composition with the dark bottom cropped out. But still a great photo.', '2004-07-12 21:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(808030, 89227, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and take on the challenge. Detail and focus on the shot is nice. I think if it had more of a focal point or "subject" (for lack of a better word) it may have increased its impact. Just my $.02, still a nice shot.</td>', 'Nice idea and take on the challenge. Detail and focus on the shot is nice. I think if it had more of a focal point or "subject" (for lack of a better word) it may have increased its impact. Just my $.02, still a nice shot.', '2004-07-12 21:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(808035, 90568, 18403, '<td valign="top">Ah yes, childhood!  That time in our lives when our parents dictate our every move!</td>', 'Ah yes, childhood!  That time in our lives when our parents dictate our every move!', '2004-07-12 21:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(808060, 90310, 23394, '<td valign="top">While I like the color and lighting, this seems to be more of a snapshot hoping to fit the challenge.  Maybe if you had had the opportunity to shoot a few more shots capturing different facial expressions?  Also, without more background context, I can''t tell if you had any other cropping alternatives.</td>', 'While I like the color and lighting, this seems to be more of a snapshot hoping to fit the challenge.  Maybe if you had had the opportunity to shoot a few more shots capturing different facial expressions?  Also, without more background context, I can''t tell if you had any other cropping alternatives.', '2004-07-12 22:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(808063, 89226, 18403, '<td valign="top">Wry commentary!  6</td>', 'Wry commentary!  6', '2004-07-12 22:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(808068, 90526, 23394, '<td valign="top">I get the idea, but the negative space doesn''t hold my attention.  This needs more in order to get the picture to tell its story.</td>', 'I get the idea, but the negative space doesn''t hold my attention.  This needs more in order to get the picture to tell its story.', '2004-07-12 22:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(808073, 90108, 23394, '<td valign="top">The tree in the foreground kills this.  If you have the opportunity, try to scoot around for different angles.  This probably could have been an interesting opportunity if you could have gotten behind the calves.  The lighting and the colors are nice.</td>', 'The tree in the foreground kills this.  If you have the opportunity, try to scoot around for different angles.  This probably could have been an interesting opportunity if you could have gotten behind the calves.  The lighting and the colors are nice.', '2004-07-12 22:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(808077, 90361, 23394, '<td valign="top">This is a tough shot to pull off.  You need flash (or some other light) to get the colors, but the flash itself is too harsh.  On the other hand, if you were simply trying to convey "escape" to freedom, you probably could have skipped the flash.  Next time, try shooting it with and without.</td>', 'This is a tough shot to pull off.  You need flash (or some other light) to get the colors, but the flash itself is too harsh.  On the other hand, if you were simply trying to convey "escape" to freedom, you probably could have skipped the flash.  Next time, try shooting it with and without.', '2004-07-12 22:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(808080, 90433, 18403, '<td valign="top">Cute!!</td>', 'Cute!!', '2004-07-12 22:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(808081, 89870, 23394, '<td valign="top">This emotion/state is mind is so hard to capture; it takes a lot of practice.  Try a faster shutter speed and/or a higher ISO.  The lighting would be ok, but you don''t want quite so much exposure.</td>', 'This emotion/state is mind is so hard to capture; it takes a lot of practice.  Try a faster shutter speed and/or a higher ISO.  The lighting would be ok, but you don''t want quite so much exposure.', '2004-07-12 22:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(808083, 89468, 18403, '<td valign="top">Judging from the star trails, the shutter was open for a minute or more.  How do you keep the noise level down? 7</td>', 'Judging from the star trails, the shutter was open for a minute or more.  How do you keep the noise level down? 7', '2004-07-12 22:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(808087, 90144, 23394, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure what I would do to make this a better picture or what could raise its score...I''ll just go with the ''kinda reaching''</td>', 'I''m not quite sure what I would do to make this a better picture or what could raise its score...I''ll just go with the ''kinda reaching''', '2004-07-12 22:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(808088, 90493, 18403, '<td valign="top">Not if the ACLU prevails!!!</td>', 'Not if the ACLU prevails!!!', '2004-07-12 22:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(808098, 90418, 23394, '<td valign="top">The title can almost pull this into the challenge, but...the cropping, lighting, lack of sharpness, etc, says this is a snapshot.  The expression has potential.  Maybe next time, try a different angle with different lighting?</td>', 'The title can almost pull this into the challenge, but...the cropping, lighting, lack of sharpness, etc, says this is a snapshot.  The expression has potential.  Maybe next time, try a different angle with different lighting?', '2004-07-12 22:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(808105, 90001, 23694, '<td valign="top">Wonderful background, almost looks surreal.</td>', 'Wonderful background, almost looks surreal.', '2004-07-12 22:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(808107, 89696, 23394, '<td valign="top">While the lines give this some potential, it could benefit from less exposure and more DOF.  Also, check your WB setting when you head indoors.</td>', 'While the lines give this some potential, it could benefit from less exposure and more DOF.  Also, check your WB setting when you head indoors.', '2004-07-12 22:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(808110, 90314, 23394, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it...ok, it''s a moth, but where is it and what is it doing?  The picture is not telling me anything.  The color is interesting, but the over-exposure in the foreground hurts.  Maybe backing up and giving more context might help?</td>', 'I don''t get it...ok, it''s a moth, but where is it and what is it doing?  The picture is not telling me anything.  The color is interesting, but the over-exposure in the foreground hurts.  Maybe backing up and giving more context might help?', '2004-07-12 22:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(808116, 89407, 18403, '<td valign="top">A little blurry but otherwise naked!</td>', 'A little blurry but otherwise naked!', '2004-07-12 22:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(808117, 90341, 23394, '<td valign="top">I know it''s not easy getting this close to a bird''s face, but other than the title, this seems to be stretching the challenge.  Also, when you have this opportunity, try focusing on the tip of the beak, but with enough DOF to keep the eyes sharp.  This picture could also benefit from more space around the top of the head (the neck feathers don''t really add much).</td>', 'I know it''s not easy getting this close to a bird''s face, but other than the title, this seems to be stretching the challenge.  Also, when you have this opportunity, try focusing on the tip of the beak, but with enough DOF to keep the eyes sharp.  This picture could also benefit from more space around the top of the head (the neck feathers don''t really add much).', '2004-07-12 22:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(808121, 90496, 23394, '<td valign="top">Nice snapshot!  Great moment to capture (and not one that comes along that often...unless you work there).</td>', 'Nice snapshot!  Great moment to capture (and not one that comes along that often...unless you work there).', '2004-07-12 22:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(808125, 90189, 23394, '<td valign="top">More context and contrasting skies could help this picture.  I know, I know, sometimes you have only the subject and the sky of the moment, and you don''t have the opportunity to come back the next day...Anyway, when you do have a subject like this, shoot it up from all angles, in close and further away.  Don''t just go for the quick snapshot (unless your travelling companions are threatening to leave you behind).</td>', 'More context and contrasting skies could help this picture.  I know, I know, sometimes you have only the subject and the sky of the moment, and you don''t have the opportunity to come back the next day...Anyway, when you do have a subject like this, shoot it up from all angles, in close and further away.  Don''t just go for the quick snapshot (unless your travelling companions are threatening to leave you behind).', '2004-07-12 22:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(808129, 89534, 23394, '<td valign="top">This is a tough picture to take, and it takes a lot of practice to get it ''just like in the brochures.''  The top to flowers are distracting, and the DOF is too shallow.  It''s hard to get this to come out right in the middle of the day without the benefit of filters.  Looks like a great place to shoot.</td>', 'This is a tough picture to take, and it takes a lot of practice to get it ''just like in the brochures.''  The top to flowers are distracting, and the DOF is too shallow.  It''s hard to get this to come out right in the middle of the day without the benefit of filters.  Looks like a great place to shoot.', '2004-07-12 22:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(808131, 90348, 18403, '<td valign="top">Alas, poor yorick! 6</td>', 'Alas, poor yorick! 6', '2004-07-12 22:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(808132, 90022, 23394, '<td valign="top">This just didn''t say ''freedom'' to me, but I''ve been known to miss things before.  The clouds are nice, the shot seems to lack an overall sharpness.</td>', 'This just didn''t say ''freedom'' to me, but I''ve been known to miss things before.  The clouds are nice, the shot seems to lack an overall sharpness.', '2004-07-12 22:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(808136, 90390, 23394, '<td valign="top">I had to come back to this one a couple times to get it.  Maybe if the fountains were a little more apparent in a first or second glance (or if other fully dressed people where more visible).  The lighting is nice for a midday shot, and the focus is sharp.  For the picture to work for me, it just needs more context.</td>', 'I had to come back to this one a couple times to get it.  Maybe if the fountains were a little more apparent in a first or second glance (or if other fully dressed people where more visible).  The lighting is nice for a midday shot, and the focus is sharp.  For the picture to work for me, it just needs more context.', '2004-07-12 22:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(808138, 90181, 23394, '<td valign="top">Maybe from a different angle with different lighting, this picture might do more.  Cropped the way it is, it just doesn''t do much for me.  It does seem to have potential as a subject.</td>', 'Maybe from a different angle with different lighting, this picture might do more.  Cropped the way it is, it just doesn''t do much for me.  It does seem to have potential as a subject.', '2004-07-12 22:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(808140, 90144, 18403, '<td valign="top">Not to worry, most of the entries are ''reaching'', including mine!</td>', 'Not to worry, most of the entries are ''reaching'', including mine!', '2004-07-12 22:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(808141, 90580, 18403, '<td valign="top">All right, it is a great picture of a clock!</td>', 'All right, it is a great picture of a clock!', '2004-07-12 22:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(808143, 90152, 23394, '<td valign="top">Freedom, confidence, or constraints...I''m not seeing the relevance to the challenge here.  The jacket is overexposed, drawing attention away from way should be garnering attention.  The colors are nice, but the cropping keeps the picture from telling its story.</td>', 'Freedom, confidence, or constraints...I''m not seeing the relevance to the challenge here.  The jacket is overexposed, drawing attention away from way should be garnering attention.  The colors are nice, but the cropping keeps the picture from telling its story.', '2004-07-12 23:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(808144, 90577, 18403, '<td valign="top">This works!!!</td>', 'This works!!!', '2004-07-12 23:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(808146, 90356, 16829, '<td valign="top">More imagination than most, and well-rendered!</td>', 'More imagination than most, and well-rendered!', '2004-07-12 23:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(808149, 90507, 18403, '<td valign="top">Looks good to me!</td>', 'Looks good to me!', '2004-07-12 23:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(808153, 90287, 23394, '<td valign="top">And this represents freedom how?  I guess freedom of expression.  Maybe try this at a different time of day when the light is not so harsh.  Also, try different angles so you can find the one that really flies.  I like the background, but can''t tell if he''s on a cliff.  Obviously, with some work, there is some potential here, but, unfortunately, for me, for this challenge, I can''t score it any higher.</td>', 'And this represents freedom how?  I guess freedom of expression.  Maybe try this at a different time of day when the light is not so harsh.  Also, try different angles so you can find the one that really flies.  I like the background, but can''t tell if he''s on a cliff.  Obviously, with some work, there is some potential here, but, unfortunately, for me, for this challenge, I can''t score it any higher.', '2004-07-12 23:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(808156, 90487, 23394, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see this meeting the challenge, even in title.  From a shooting perspective, the white line distracts, and the subject should be facing into the picture.  Maybe next time you have this opportunity, try getting the camera down to street level rather than at snapshot level.  Also, rather than just taking a picture of a squirrel, try capturing some context to add to the story.</td>', 'I don''t really see this meeting the challenge, even in title.  From a shooting perspective, the white line distracts, and the subject should be facing into the picture.  Maybe next time you have this opportunity, try getting the camera down to street level rather than at snapshot level.  Also, rather than just taking a picture of a squirrel, try capturing some context to add to the story.', '2004-07-12 23:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(808164, 89750, 23394, '<td valign="top">Ok, school''s out and you are free to do whatever you want, including staying up past your bedtime.  Unfortunately, the light from the TV isn''t enough.  There''s just not enough sharpness to make me want to sift through the whole picture to see what the story is.  Maybe a little more emphasis on the person might help.</td>', 'Ok, school''s out and you are free to do whatever you want, including staying up past your bedtime.  Unfortunately, the light from the TV isn''t enough.  There''s just not enough sharpness to make me want to sift through the whole picture to see what the story is.  Maybe a little more emphasis on the person might help.', '2004-07-12 23:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(808166, 90480, 18403, '<td valign="top">Escargot! 8</td>', 'Escargot! 8', '2004-07-12 23:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(808173, 90511, 18403, '<td valign="top">Banned?  Where?</td>', 'Banned?  Where?', '2004-07-12 23:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(808178, 90516, 18403, '<td valign="top">The foreground looks muddy, but not blurry.  Maybe levels adjustment would help.</td>', 'The foreground looks muddy, but not blurry.  Maybe levels adjustment would help.', '2004-07-12 23:25:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(808181, 90219, 18403, '<td valign="top">The water looks over sharpened, almost has an embossed quality.</td>', 'The water looks over sharpened, almost has an embossed quality.', '2004-07-12 23:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(808213, 89468, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea and excellent composition. If only the yellow liines and road were clean...</td>', 'Great idea and excellent composition. If only the yellow liines and road were clean...', '2004-07-12 23:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(808215, 90487, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great composition, and a rare case of an effective frame.</td>', 'Great composition, and a rare case of an effective frame.', '2004-07-12 23:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(808219, 90341, 10720, '<td valign="top">Cute picture and cute caption. Nice background too.</td>', 'Cute picture and cute caption. Nice background too.', '2004-07-12 23:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(808238, 90507, 7485, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity and subtle colors a lot. I don''t know if this was an option, but the composition would have been much stronger if you had moved to the right and either up or down, such that the cannon was further away from the cross and not aligned with the water''s edge.</td>', 'I like the simplicity and subtle colors a lot. I don''t know if this was an option, but the composition would have been much stronger if you had moved to the right and either up or down, such that the cannon was further away from the cross and not aligned with the water''s edge.', '2004-07-13 00:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(808260, 90308, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great moment! But is it my imagination or is there a little color in the trees?</td>', 'Great moment! But is it my imagination or is there a little color in the trees?', '2004-07-13 00:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(808261, 90540, 19538, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, but the pen kills it. I think a fountain pen would have a major improvement. .</td>', 'Very nice photo, but the pen kills it. I think a fountain pen would have a major improvement. .', '2004-07-13 00:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(808268, 90205, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative and well composed!</td>', 'Very imaginative and well composed!', '2004-07-13 00:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(808278, 90111, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea and composition, but I''m not sure desaturating the face helps</td>', 'Great idea and composition, but I''m not sure desaturating the face helps', '2004-07-13 00:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(808410, 90376, 6349, '<td valign="top">hahaha.  your self portraits are the best.  i can''t image how big the collection you have of them will be in a few years.  you''ll have to start your own museum or something.  i love your experimentation with expressions and moods.  they are often meaningful and whimsical at the same time.  keep up the great work.</td>', 'hahaha.  your self portraits are the best.  i can''t image how big the collection you have of them will be in a few years.  you''ll have to start your own museum or something.  i love your experimentation with expressions and moods.  they are often meaningful and whimsical at the same time.  keep up the great work.', '2004-07-13 01:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(808415, 89878, 20375, '<td valign="top">The paper covering the mouth has no reason to run off the page. No need for<br/>nude model to make the point. Too much blur.</td>', 'The paper covering the mouth has no reason to run off the page. No need fornude model to make the point. Too much blur.', '2004-07-13 01:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(808421, 90569, 20375, '<td valign="top">Let''s hope she doesn''t come back. Sell the rings and buy a nifty new camera with the money. ...lol<br/>Good effort, well composed.</td>', 'Let''s hope she doesn''t come back. Sell the rings and buy a nifty new camera with the money. ...lolGood effort, well composed.', '2004-07-13 01:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(808425, 90418, 6349, '<td valign="top">hahahaha.  not that there''s anything wrong with wearing a kilt...the title and the expression and pose are hilarious.</td>', 'hahahaha.  not that there''s anything wrong with wearing a kilt...the title and the expression and pose are hilarious.', '2004-07-13 01:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(808429, 89210, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is my top pick for the challenge by tremendous margins.  Thank you for sharing your talent. 10</td>', 'This is my top pick for the challenge by tremendous margins.  Thank you for sharing your talent. 10', '2004-07-13 01:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(808434, 90433, 6349, '<td valign="top">My choice for second place.  There''s just something perfect about this.  Thank you for sharing it.  Good luck in the challenge.  10</td>', 'My choice for second place.  There''s just something perfect about this.  Thank you for sharing it.  Good luck in the challenge.  10', '2004-07-13 01:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(808442, 90356, 6349, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I predict that this will ribbon.  The lighting and focus are excellent.  I really really like the wood grain and the color of the marbles.  I think many people would have gone for a more dramatic setup on a plain white table that I don''t think would have had the same effect.  The idea, of course, is outstanding!  10</td>', 'Wow.  I predict that this will ribbon.  The lighting and focus are excellent.  I really really like the wood grain and the color of the marbles.  I think many people would have gone for a more dramatic setup on a plain white table that I don''t think would have had the same effect.  The idea, of course, is outstanding!  10', '2004-07-13 01:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(808446, 90452, 6349, '<td valign="top">Super image.  I love the pale blues and pinks and the lines of surf and sky.  I would airbrush out the tattoo unless that was the message you were going for.  I think it draws the eye too much.  Overall it''s nice to see a photo that is definetely in my top 5 for the challenge that is light.  A lot of the better winning photos have been rather lowkey lately.  Time for a change! 10</td>', 'Super image.  I love the pale blues and pinks and the lines of surf and sky.  I would airbrush out the tattoo unless that was the message you were going for.  I think it draws the eye too much.  Overall it''s nice to see a photo that is definetely in my top 5 for the challenge that is light.  A lot of the better winning photos have been rather lowkey lately.  Time for a change! 10', '2004-07-13 02:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(808449, 90500, 6349, '<td valign="top">Heida?  This is a great photo.  Great lighting and tones.  The only thing i would change is to leave a little more room on the right after the fingers (probablly about the amount that would be there if you added a border on top of the photo).  10</td>', 'Heida?  This is a great photo.  Great lighting and tones.  The only thing i would change is to leave a little more room on the right after the fingers (probablly about the amount that would be there if you added a border on top of the photo).  10', '2004-07-13 02:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(808452, 90308, 6349, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this photo.  It is my choice for third place.  Best of luck in the challenge. 10</td>', 'I absolutely love this photo.  It is my choice for third place.  Best of luck in the challenge. 10', '2004-07-13 02:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(808453, 90406, 6349, '<td valign="top">Super photograph.  Top 10 for sure.  10</td>', 'Super photograph.  Top 10 for sure.  10', '2004-07-13 02:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
