(808615, 90161, 12319, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I would have tended to go towards higher contrast and lower brightness. The cuffs have an almost butterfly shape to them, unsure as to whether this was intentional, but this conjures up memories of "Papillon". A well trained butterfly, at rest, atop the cuffs would have been an assured winner.<br/> <br/>Good Luck</td>', 'Nice shot, I would have tended to go towards higher contrast and lower brightness. The cuffs have an almost butterfly shape to them, unsure as to whether this was intentional, but this conjures up memories of "Papillon". A well trained butterfly, at rest, atop the cuffs would have been an assured winner. Good Luck', '2004-07-13 05:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(808616, 90562, 12319, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation, would have gone more contrasty myself as the shot looks a bit like a snapshot, maybe desaturation would have assisted.<br/> <br/>Good Luck</td>', 'Nice interpretation, would have gone more contrasty myself as the shot looks a bit like a snapshot, maybe desaturation would have assisted. Good Luck', '2004-07-13 06:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
