(809080, 89973, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. No wonder the eagle is our symbol of freedom.</td>', 'Great action shot. No wonder the eagle is our symbol of freedom.', '2004-07-13 13:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(809081, 90213, 2764, '<td valign="top">ooh nice - try it in balck and white, or sepia and see how it looks</td>', 'ooh nice - try it in balck and white, or sepia and see how it looks', '2004-07-13 13:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(809083, 90219, 2764, '<td valign="top">straighten the horizon - pet peeve of mine but it puts many voters off</td>', 'straighten the horizon - pet peeve of mine but it puts many voters off', '2004-07-13 13:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(809084, 90001, 12733, '<td valign="top">Who said you have to keep your horizon line straight??? This is a great rule-breaker, as well as having a perfect sky and a beautiful and unobtrusive background. Gret shot.</td>', 'Who said you have to keep your horizon line straight??? This is a great rule-breaker, as well as having a perfect sky and a beautiful and unobtrusive background. Gret shot.', '2004-07-13 13:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(809086, 90582, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice crowd shot - the colors stand out.</td>', 'Nice crowd shot - the colors stand out.', '2004-07-13 13:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(809088, 90580, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of texture and detail. This is the kind of picture that can keep you looking to figure out what it means. How does a clock without hands relate to freedom? It seems to offer boundless possibilities.</td>', 'Nice capture of texture and detail. This is the kind of picture that can keep you looking to figure out what it means. How does a clock without hands relate to freedom? It seems to offer boundless possibilities.', '2004-07-13 13:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(809090, 90387, 2764, '<td valign="top">I think the heavy black frame accentuates the over saturated colors, unofrtuneatly in a negative way.  I''m going to guess that you ger some "oversautrated" comments that you wouldn''t have gotten without the frame.  A picture submitted for these contests does not need the frame treatment that a photo on display would.  There is already the frame of the computer screen and the grey DPC frame.  Adding orders is a delicate thing and many voters mark down for distracting ones.  Study some of the winners - most have a border that is thinner than this one.  Yes, I like the image but it seems secondary to the frame.</td>', 'I think the heavy black frame accentuates the over saturated colors, unofrtuneatly in a negative way.  I''m going to guess that you ger some "oversautrated" comments that you wouldn''t have gotten without the frame.  A picture submitted for these contests does not need the frame treatment that a photo on display would.  There is already the frame of the computer screen and the grey DPC frame.  Adding orders is a delicate thing and many voters mark down for distracting ones.  Study some of the winners - most have a border that is thinner than this one.  Yes, I like the image but it seems secondary to the frame.', '2004-07-13 13:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(809092, 90357, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and shapes of the trees, and the fence. The riders seem to be going off into an open and free future, and the curve in the road gives the feeling of more distance ahead.</td>', 'I like the colors and shapes of the trees, and the fence. The riders seem to be going off into an open and free future, and the curve in the road gives the feeling of more distance ahead.', '2004-07-13 14:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(809093, 90155, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.</td>', 'Beautiful capture.', '2004-07-13 14:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(809114, 90361, 21362, '<td valign="top">Not entirely sure this says freedom to me, especially without the title, but I do love this. I love how it just on the edge of being an abstract - I think being on the dark side helps, along with the unusual colors. Very interesting photo!</td>', 'Not entirely sure this says freedom to me, especially without the title, but I do love this. I love how it just on the edge of being an abstract - I think being on the dark side helps, along with the unusual colors. Very interesting photo!', '2004-07-13 14:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(809116, 90213, 318, '<td valign="top">This could have been better if you would have shown the freedom view the person is looking at.</td>', 'This could have been better if you would have shown the freedom view the person is looking at.', '2004-07-13 14:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(809122, 90353, 22671, '<td valign="top">Even without looking at any other photos, I already want to give this one a 10.  Everything about the picture is good.  Great focus.  Crisp contrast with the deep blue sky and the striking kite strings that lead the viewer up to the free and boundless heights.  I feel like I''m starting to write a poem so I''d better stop myself and just give you the 10 right now.  Congrats on the perfect pic for the challenge.</td>', 'Even without looking at any other photos, I already want to give this one a 10.  Everything about the picture is good.  Great focus.  Crisp contrast with the deep blue sky and the striking kite strings that lead the viewer up to the free and boundless heights.  I feel like I''m starting to write a poem so I''d better stop myself and just give you the 10 right now.  Congrats on the perfect pic for the challenge.', '2004-07-13 14:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(809130, 90452, 22671, '<td valign="top">It looks like a painting.  Quite lovely.</td>', 'It looks like a painting.  Quite lovely.', '2004-07-13 14:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(809135, 90577, 22671, '<td valign="top">I love how the picture has just enough to tell the story.  No distractions.  Just right.</td>', 'I love how the picture has just enough to tell the story.  No distractions.  Just right.', '2004-07-13 14:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(809147, 90356, 22671, '<td valign="top">The lighting and colors make the picture look very classy and sophisticated.  It almost makes me want to get myself a nice tall glass of whiskey on the rocks despite the fact that I don''t drink.  Unfortunately the mood of the story that the picture tells is a more light and humorous one, which creates some overall incongruity.  Aside from that, it''s still an excellently taken picture and I''m rooting for it to do very well in this challenge.</td>', 'The lighting and colors make the picture look very classy and sophisticated.  It almost makes me want to get myself a nice tall glass of whiskey on the rocks despite the fact that I don''t drink.  Unfortunately the mood of the story that the picture tells is a more light and humorous one, which creates some overall incongruity.  Aside from that, it''s still an excellently taken picture and I''m rooting for it to do very well in this challenge.', '2004-07-13 15:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(809189, 90577, 22046, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea. I like pictures that cause one to stop and think and this one does.</td>', 'Very clever idea. I like pictures that cause one to stop and think and this one does.', '2004-07-13 15:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(809192, 90124, 22046, '<td valign="top">A very sad image. This looks more like the opposite of freedom but it gets the point across.</td>', 'A very sad image. This looks more like the opposite of freedom but it gets the point across.', '2004-07-13 15:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(809193, 90397, 22046, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge very well.</td>', 'This fits the challenge very well.', '2004-07-13 15:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(809195, 90356, 22046, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh... very clever idea. But where does his freedom lead? ;)</td>', 'Made me laugh... very clever idea. But where does his freedom lead? ;)', '2004-07-13 15:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(809197, 90001, 22046, '<td valign="top">Nice open free feeling to this one.</td>', 'Nice open free feeling to this one.', '2004-07-13 15:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(809201, 90389, 22046, '<td valign="top">Yes this represents one of our many freedoms. I like her sad expression and the colors in this.</td>', 'Yes this represents one of our many freedoms. I like her sad expression and the colors in this.', '2004-07-13 15:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(809203, 90583, 22046, '<td valign="top">This cow picture works for me. They look free. I like that there are different colors and sizes of animals in the wooded setting.</td>', 'This cow picture works for me. They look free. I like that there are different colors and sizes of animals in the wooded setting.', '2004-07-13 15:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(809205, 90354, 22046, '<td valign="top">Amazing sunset and great take on the subject.</td>', 'Amazing sunset and great take on the subject.', '2004-07-13 15:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(809208, 90500, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have a well designed image with loads of mystery.   I wonder how it would look with really red fingernails.  The white line in the boder draws too much attention.</td>', 'You have a well designed image with loads of mystery.   I wonder how it would look with really red fingernails.  The white line in the boder draws too much attention.', '2004-07-13 15:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
