(809213, 89168, 19608, '<td valign="top">The fish-eye lens makes this a rather unusual image.  The white sky was terrible - but you did really well to get rid of it the best you could.  Title and subject definitely meet the freedom theme.</td>', 'The fish-eye lens makes this a rather unusual image.  The white sky was terrible - but you did really well to get rid of it the best you could.  Title and subject definitely meet the freedom theme.', '2004-07-13 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
