(809223, 90111, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is perhaps the best entry in this contest. It is about the very nature of freedom. The composition is superb. Is air not free? Is beauty not free?<br/>Is nature not free? Congratulations on this beautiful study.</td>', 'This is perhaps the best entry in this contest. It is about the very nature of freedom. The composition is superb. Is air not free? Is beauty not free?Is nature not free? Congratulations on this beautiful study.', '2004-07-13 15:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
