(809341, 90580, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love this idea and it conveys the challenge theme to me perfectly. It could be improved by placing the clock on a coloured background or even on a non textured background and by use of softer, more even lighting. 8</td>', 'I love this idea and it conveys the challenge theme to me perfectly. It could be improved by placing the clock on a coloured background or even on a non textured background and by use of softer, more even lighting. 8', '2004-07-13 17:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
