(809388, 90308, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a calm bucolic scene... Doesn''t convey freedom incredibly strongly but I can certainly see how it fits the challenge. I like the choice of black and white and the composition you have cropped to. 7</td>', 'What a calm bucolic scene... Doesn''t convey freedom incredibly strongly but I can certainly see how it fits the challenge. I like the choice of black and white and the composition you have cropped to. 7', '2004-07-13 17:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
