(809399, 89878, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very unique take and must not have been easy! I think, for me, the hand reaching out being a total blur hurts it, and not sure if I would prefer the two-tone high-key if I could see it presented in other ways also. But your vision of what you wanted is the deciding factor, regardless.</td>', 'Very unique take and must not have been easy! I think, for me, the hand reaching out being a total blur hurts it, and not sure if I would prefer the two-tone high-key if I could see it presented in other ways also. But your vision of what you wanted is the deciding factor, regardless.', '2004-07-13 17:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(809419, 90355, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful soft colors and a classic building. I hope everyone notices that it is a library (not a courthouse, etc.) and really thinks about it. It may be a bit too tight of a crop rendering it dead center, but just an opinion. It brings out the building and keeps your attention on it, but also lessens "eye interest" .</td>', 'Beautiful soft colors and a classic building. I hope everyone notices that it is a library (not a courthouse, etc.) and really thinks about it. It may be a bit too tight of a crop rendering it dead center, but just an opinion. It brings out the building and keeps your attention on it, but also lessens "eye interest" .', '2004-07-13 17:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(809423, 89750, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very funny take! Dark on this particular monitor, but also need s to be presented pretty dark to work.</td>', 'Very funny take! Dark on this particular monitor, but also need s to be presented pretty dark to work.', '2004-07-13 17:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(809428, 90419, 20779, '<td valign="top">I think the photo is too blurry to score very high, and I probably would have used much less surrounding space around the dog. Has some of the "snapshot" look.</td>', 'I think the photo is too blurry to score very high, and I probably would have used much less surrounding space around the dog. Has some of the "snapshot" look.', '2004-07-13 17:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(809431, 90507, 14603, '<td valign="top">The idea is there but there`s quite a lot in the image that isn`t working for me.<br/>A lot of foreground and seascape where the eye will wander to but where nothing is happening. <br/>Maybe getting closer to the wheel of the cannon and also getting a lower viewpoint which would just incorporate just the cannon, the cross and the sky would give the image more impact. However,I stress that this is a purely personal preference and shouldn`t be taken as a criticism of your image which may work for many voters in it`s present form.</td>', 'The idea is there but there`s quite a lot in the image that isn`t working for me.A lot of foreground and seascape where the eye will wander to but where nothing is happening. Maybe getting closer to the wheel of the cannon and also getting a lower viewpoint which would just incorporate just the cannon, the cross and the sky would give the image more impact. However,I stress that this is a purely personal preference and shouldn`t be taken as a criticism of your image which may work for many voters in it`s present form.', '2004-07-13 17:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(809435, 90433, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful take and girl; the motion blur doesn''t work for me in this one, but that is wholly an opinion. I would have preferred her to be in better focus, with the background blurred. Resolution appears to be poor, but could be the blur giving it that effect.</td>', 'Beautiful take and girl; the motion blur doesn''t work for me in this one, but that is wholly an opinion. I would have preferred her to be in better focus, with the background blurred. Resolution appears to be poor, but could be the blur giving it that effect.', '2004-07-13 17:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
