(810516, 90267, 12802, '<td valign="top">I didn''t look at the title first here but I knew exactly what you were trying to get across.  It''s a great shot, seems a little dark on my monitor, maybe tweating the levels and bringing up the colours would have helped.  I really like this shot, well done!  9</td>', 'I didn''t look at the title first here but I knew exactly what you were trying to get across.  It''s a great shot, seems a little dark on my monitor, maybe tweating the levels and bringing up the colours would have helped.  I really like this shot, well done!  9', '2004-07-14 05:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(810520, 90353, 12802, '<td valign="top">Really like this!  You''ve taken this from a great angle, really helps us to see what the boy is seeing!  Esposure is perfect, nice and sharp! Well done, full marks!</td>', 'Really like this!  You''ve taken this from a great angle, really helps us to see what the boy is seeing!  Esposure is perfect, nice and sharp! Well done, full marks!', '2004-07-14 05:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
