(810687, 90360, 20204, '<td valign="top">This shot has potential, but my initial thought was that there isn''t enough contrast between the design elements.  With the right lighting, or a more dramatic sky (sunset/sunrise) this would be vastly improved.</td>', 'This shot has potential, but my initial thought was that there isn''t enough contrast between the design elements.  With the right lighting, or a more dramatic sky (sunset/sunrise) this would be vastly improved.', '2004-07-14 09:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
