(810706, 90357, 20204, '<td valign="top">This image is overexposed - the highlights on the right cyclist''s shirt are blown out.  Onfortunately, a sa subject, this makes for a distraction.  Might have been better to spot meter lower in the shot and take some underexposure in the trees.</td>', 'This image is overexposed - the highlights on the right cyclist''s shirt are blown out.  Onfortunately, a sa subject, this makes for a distraction.  Might have been better to spot meter lower in the shot and take some underexposure in the trees.', '2004-07-14 09:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
