(811274, 90353, 21362, '<td valign="top">Seems oversaturated to me (not a fan of that look myself) but otherwise a great shot. The perspective ads interest, great contrast between the red shirt, blue sky, and pink/yellow kite. And the clouds are great too. This shot would''ve seemed boring if the sky was solid blue. Well done!</td>', 'Seems oversaturated to me (not a fan of that look myself) but otherwise a great shot. The perspective ads interest, great contrast between the red shirt, blue sky, and pink/yellow kite. And the clouds are great too. This shot would''ve seemed boring if the sky was solid blue. Well done!', '2004-07-14 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(811276, 90376, 21362, '<td valign="top">Very good.</td>', 'Very good.', '2004-07-14 14:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
