(811642, 90480, 8860, '<td valign="top">Cute and well composed, although a little too far to the left. Snali is a touch too bleached out. I used to collect snails as a kid - I had 103 in my bedroom and I left the lid of once and found most of them stuck to my bedroom wall!</td>', 'Cute and well composed, although a little too far to the left. Snali is a touch too bleached out. I used to collect snails as a kid - I had 103 in my bedroom and I left the lid of once and found most of them stuck to my bedroom wall!', '2004-07-14 17:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(811772, 90511, 13602, '<td valign="top">I don''t think Mark Twain, whas ever banned anywhere. I whas a child in one of the whorst communist dictatorships ever, lots of books where banned but not the adventures of Tom Sawyer. I remember reading it as a child :)) Anyways the ideea of the image is good.</td>', 'I don''t think Mark Twain, whas ever banned anywhere. I whas a child in one of the whorst communist dictatorships ever, lots of books where banned but not the adventures of Tom Sawyer. I remember reading it as a child :)) Anyways the ideea of the image is good.', '2004-07-14 18:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(811934, 90500, 17203, '<td valign="top">This is a really creepy shot. I think you lose something with such a nicely manicured hand in this situation. I''d remove the ring, get the hand nice and dirty, and contort the fingers a little to really show the struggle. Maybe B&amp;W too. Still, a very creative approach! 7</td>', 'This is a really creepy shot. I think you lose something with such a nicely manicured hand in this situation. I''d remove the ring, get the hand nice and dirty, and contort the fingers a little to really show the struggle. Maybe B&W too. Still, a very creative approach! 7', '2004-07-14 20:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(811940, 90144, 17203, '<td valign="top">You might have pulled it off if the cat didn''t seem so content. That sort of ruins any sense of detention.</td>', 'You might have pulled it off if the cat didn''t seem so content. That sort of ruins any sense of detention.', '2004-07-14 20:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(811992, 90577, 14863, '<td valign="top">I really like this one- I like that it''s very unnatural, that it''s very matter of fact and the hint of the feathers. This makes me laugh- great job 10</td>', 'I really like this one- I like that it''s very unnatural, that it''s very matter of fact and the hint of the feathers. This makes me laugh- great job 10', '2004-07-14 21:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(811993, 90446, 10402, '<td valign="top">My first impression was that a metal chain would have been better. But the image would not have been nearly so striking. And the more I consider it, there are lots of things in all of our lives that limit our freedom, but that with the same effort as breaking a plastic chain (not insignificant, but not impossible) we could break out of and be more free. So to me, this photo not only catches the eye, but has a great symbolic meaning.</td>', 'My first impression was that a metal chain would have been better. But the image would not have been nearly so striking. And the more I consider it, there are lots of things in all of our lives that limit our freedom, but that with the same effort as breaking a plastic chain (not insignificant, but not impossible) we could break out of and be more free. So to me, this photo not only catches the eye, but has a great symbolic meaning.', '2004-07-14 21:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(811994, 89830, 14863, '<td valign="top">This one''s hilarious. I love the muted colors and the range of colors. The boys are adorable and I can relate, sometimes a bench is just so inviting :P 10</td>', 'This one''s hilarious. I love the muted colors and the range of colors. The boys are adorable and I can relate, sometimes a bench is just so inviting :P 10', '2004-07-14 21:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
