(811997, 90486, 14863, '<td valign="top">Yay! Love to run through a field- that looks like fun. This would be even better if she was running or something or if she was wearing a different outfit like some kind of dress. Great job! 10</td>', 'Yay! Love to run through a field- that looks like fun. This would be even better if she was running or something or if she was wearing a different outfit like some kind of dress. Great job! 10', '2004-07-14 21:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
