(812033, 90578, 10402, '<td valign="top">Bundled in that harness, she doesn''t look very free! But in that position without it she would be terrified, not excited, so there is a great message here about freedom. I think a vertical format would have worked better here, with the negative space above and below instead of to the side. (Less harsh lighting would have been nice too, but there isn''t much you could do about that!)</td>', 'Bundled in that harness, she doesn''t look very free! But in that position without it she would be terrified, not excited, so there is a great message here about freedom. I think a vertical format would have worked better here, with the negative space above and below instead of to the side. (Less harsh lighting would have been nice too, but there isn''t much you could do about that!)', '2004-07-14 21:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
