(812076, 90354, 10402, '<td valign="top">At first glimpse I thought the model was facing me and was going to complain that it needed more space on the left. Then suddenly it switched and I now see the model facing away, and the image makes a lot more sense! (And the composition is perfect.) An interesting property of some silhouettes.</td>', 'At first glimpse I thought the model was facing me and was going to complain that it needed more space on the left. Then suddenly it switched and I now see the model facing away, and the image makes a lot more sense! (And the composition is perfect.) An interesting property of some silhouettes.', '2004-07-14 21:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
