(812090, 90205, 16523, '<td valign="top">nice view</td>', 'nice view', '2004-07-14 21:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(812095, 89994, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like the irony, although I find the link to freedom a bit tenuous. The lighting isn''t very dramatic.</td>', 'I like the irony, although I find the link to freedom a bit tenuous. The lighting isn''t very dramatic.', '2004-07-14 21:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(812096, 90500, 19474, '<td valign="top">well done Heida?<br/>would have liked to see a little bit more arm</td>', 'well done Heida?would have liked to see a little bit more arm', '2004-07-14 21:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(812118, 90516, 10402, '<td valign="top">That fence will certainly allow freedom! And it makes for a very appealing image too. The photo has a soft dreamy feel which to me isn''t a great fit with the subject. With just the field I''d prefer sharper focus and a cooler color. Add a couple in nostalgic clothing romping through the field, and this treatment would probably work well.</td>', 'That fence will certainly allow freedom! And it makes for a very appealing image too. The photo has a soft dreamy feel which to me isn''t a great fit with the subject. With just the field I''d prefer sharper focus and a cooler color. Add a couple in nostalgic clothing romping through the field, and this treatment would probably work well.', '2004-07-14 22:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(812130, 90493, 10402, '<td valign="top">You picked a great time to make this photo; the lighting is very nice. The white books are distracting; it would have been nice if they could have been removed or turned so the spine was facing the camera.</td>', 'You picked a great time to make this photo; the lighting is very nice. The white books are distracting; it would have been nice if they could have been removed or turned so the spine was facing the camera.', '2004-07-14 22:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(812161, 90583, 10402, '<td valign="top">A bit overexposed, but I love the variety of cows here.</td>', 'A bit overexposed, but I love the variety of cows here.', '2004-07-14 22:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(812170, 90002, 10402, '<td valign="top">This certainly captures the moment! I wish the focus was sharper.</td>', 'This certainly captures the moment! I wish the focus was sharper.', '2004-07-14 22:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(812472, 89534, 22734, '<td valign="top">Ah yes, freedom is subtly implied. Of course, if you ever sailed, then you are at home with this image.</td>', 'Ah yes, freedom is subtly implied. Of course, if you ever sailed, then you are at home with this image.', '2004-07-15 01:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(812481, 90353, 20407, '<td valign="top">Something about this doesn''t look quite right to me. Was the kite added later? Nice colours though.</td>', 'Something about this doesn''t look quite right to me. Was the kite added later? Nice colours though.', '2004-07-15 02:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(812523, 90112, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is cute I like it</td>', 'This is cute I like it', '2004-07-15 03:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(812544, 89878, 14526, '<td valign="top">I like the apparent mutilation and the fgeneral set-up, but could have done without the glasses and the transition in colour</td>', 'I like the apparent mutilation and the fgeneral set-up, but could have done without the glasses and the transition in colour', '2004-07-15 04:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(812559, 90356, 245, '<td valign="top">This... is awesome. :) No critique necessary.</td>', 'This... is awesome. :) No critique necessary.', '2004-07-15 04:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(812560, 90480, 245, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture! The color of the snail is so vivid against all the white!</td>', 'Excellent picture! The color of the snail is so vivid against all the white!', '2004-07-15 04:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(812614, 90111, 16636, '<td valign="top">very simple an effective - one of my favs...</td>', 'very simple an effective - one of my favs...', '2004-07-15 07:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(812619, 90356, 20407, '<td valign="top">I love this, I''ve added it to my favourites. I''ll be surprised if it doesn''t get a ribbon. Well done. 9</td>', 'I love this, I''ve added it to my favourites. I''ll be surprised if it doesn''t get a ribbon. Well done. 9', '2004-07-15 08:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(812620, 90480, 20407, '<td valign="top">What an excellent little model. It looks like he had a bath before the photo shoot, he''s lovely and clean and shiny. <br/> <br/>My favourite for the challenge. I think it''s one of the only 10''s I''ve ever given. I wish I took it. I''ve added it to my favourites :)</td>', 'What an excellent little model. It looks like he had a bath before the photo shoot, he''s lovely and clean and shiny.  My favourite for the challenge. I think it''s one of the only 10''s I''ve ever given. I wish I took it. I''ve added it to my favourites :)', '2004-07-15 08:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(812666, 90335, 23456, '<td valign="top">So simple, yet so effective ! I like it. "Free" is a word that comes to mind with this shot !</td>', 'So simple, yet so effective ! I like it. "Free" is a word that comes to mind with this shot !', '2004-07-15 10:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(812674, 90514, 16834, '<td valign="top">Bond or Bondage?</td>', 'Bond or Bondage?', '2004-07-15 10:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(812743, 89830, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice enough photo though little to really grab my interest, doesn''t seem to relate to the challenge very well.</td>', 'Nice enough photo though little to really grab my interest, doesn''t seem to relate to the challenge very well.', '2004-07-15 11:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(812744, 90417, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. The angle from which we''re viewing him seems a little strange to me.</td>', 'Interesting idea. The angle from which we''re viewing him seems a little strange to me.', '2004-07-15 11:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(812745, 90191, 3087, '<td valign="top">Fair attempt at the technique but image quality seems very poor indeed.</td>', 'Fair attempt at the technique but image quality seems very poor indeed.', '2004-07-15 11:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(812748, 89210, 3087, '<td valign="top">Don''t understand the title and the image doesn''t convey the challenge theme to me in the slightest but I like the high contrast black and white treatment.</td>', 'Don''t understand the title and the image doesn''t convey the challenge theme to me in the slightest but I like the high contrast black and white treatment.', '2004-07-15 11:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(812749, 89973, 3087, '<td valign="top">Content works well for challenge theme but photo doesn''t capture the imagination - a shot with wings more horizontal might convey the eagle gliding on the thermals?</td>', 'Content works well for challenge theme but photo doesn''t capture the imagination - a shot with wings more horizontal might convey the eagle gliding on the thermals?', '2004-07-15 11:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(812752, 90361, 3087, '<td valign="top">Strange and interesting but a little too dark overall for my tastes. Love those colours towards the right!</td>', 'Strange and interesting but a little too dark overall for my tastes. Love those colours towards the right!', '2004-07-15 12:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(812755, 89468, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not enough to hold the interest.</td>', 'Not enough to hold the interest.', '2004-07-15 12:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(812758, 89917, 3087, '<td valign="top">A great picture but it doesn''t convey the challenge theme to me. It conveys contemplation, worry, despair, boredom - many things. But the concept of freedom isn''t one of them for me.</td>', 'A great picture but it doesn''t convey the challenge theme to me. It conveys contemplation, worry, despair, boredom - many things. But the concept of freedom isn''t one of them for me.', '2004-07-15 12:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(812759, 90540, 3087, '<td valign="top">Seems a common theme... and a sad one. Of itself not a particularly interesting image though well taken and nicely cropped. Could see it used as part of an advert or magazine article.</td>', 'Seems a common theme... and a sad one. Of itself not a particularly interesting image though well taken and nicely cropped. Could see it used as part of an advert or magazine article.', '2004-07-15 12:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(812765, 90248, 3087, '<td valign="top">Needs a focal point, is too bland without it.</td>', 'Needs a focal point, is too bland without it.', '2004-07-15 12:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(812766, 89487, 3087, '<td valign="top">Background feels too detailed/ cluttered for my tastes.</td>', 'Background feels too detailed/ cluttered for my tastes.', '2004-07-15 12:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(812771, 90493, 3087, '<td valign="top">Somewhat too cluttered a composition and a little too dark. Doesn''t really convey the challenge strongly to me.</td>', 'Somewhat too cluttered a composition and a little too dark. Doesn''t really convey the challenge strongly to me.', '2004-07-15 12:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(812776, 90287, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a strange man... needs a reflector to get light onto his face?</td>', 'What a strange man... needs a reflector to get light onto his face?', '2004-07-15 12:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(812778, 90267, 3087, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea!</td>', 'An interesting idea!', '2004-07-15 12:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(812779, 90098, 3087, '<td valign="top">A nice image and the high contrast works well.</td>', 'A nice image and the high contrast works well.', '2004-07-15 12:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(812783, 90389, 3087, '<td valign="top">Focus seems soft. Would be great with direct eye contact.</td>', 'Focus seems soft. Would be great with direct eye contact.', '2004-07-15 12:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(812785, 90516, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of soft focus but it''s an interesting technique for a landscape shot.</td>', 'Not a fan of soft focus but it''s an interesting technique for a landscape shot.', '2004-07-15 12:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(812787, 90581, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely done and the background colour really complements the eye but doesn''t really convey the theme of the challenge to me at all.</td>', 'Nicely done and the background colour really complements the eye but doesn''t really convey the theme of the challenge to me at all.', '2004-07-15 12:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(812789, 88913, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not keen on the lighting but an interesting still life.</td>', 'Not keen on the lighting but an interesting still life.', '2004-07-15 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(812792, 90124, 3087, '<td valign="top">The image itself talks of oppression not of freedom from it. Nicely done but a little dark overall.</td>', 'The image itself talks of oppression not of freedom from it. Nicely done but a little dark overall.', '2004-07-15 12:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(812795, 90430, 3087, '<td valign="top">Concept interesting but cows are too far away, too centred in the frame, there are trees in the way.</td>', 'Concept interesting but cows are too far away, too centred in the frame, there are trees in the way.', '2004-07-15 12:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(812800, 90377, 3087, '<td valign="top">A sweet candid though not very sharp.</td>', 'A sweet candid though not very sharp.', '2004-07-15 12:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(812806, 90357, 3087, '<td valign="top">Feels somewhat tilted. A nice enough snapshot but nothing that leaps out and grabs the attention.</td>', 'Feels somewhat tilted. A nice enough snapshot but nothing that leaps out and grabs the attention.', '2004-07-15 12:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(812808, 90002, 3087, '<td valign="top">Too dark to see much detail and shame his wings are cropped out.</td>', 'Too dark to see much detail and shame his wings are cropped out.', '2004-07-15 12:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(812809, 90432, 3087, '<td valign="top">A nice enough view but feels too centred with nothing of real interest.</td>', 'A nice enough view but feels too centred with nothing of real interest.', '2004-07-15 12:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(812813, 90112, 3087, '<td valign="top">I get the idea of the freedom to get away but this still comes across as a family snapshot of more interest to those who know the person in it than to strangers. Nice sky though.</td>', 'I get the idea of the freedom to get away but this still comes across as a family snapshot of more interest to those who know the person in it than to strangers. Nice sky though.', '2004-07-15 12:19:29.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(812815, 90558, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great work on his part and interesting image of an artist at work but the background is too cluttered (would standing up have given a sand only background?) and doesn''t speak strongly to me of challenge theme.</td>', 'Great work on his part and interesting image of an artist at work but the background is too cluttered (would standing up have given a sand only background?) and doesn''t speak strongly to me of challenge theme.', '2004-07-15 12:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(812819, 90208, 3087, '<td valign="top">Sad that a marriage can become so bad that escape from it is a freedom. Lighting is a little harsh for my tastes.</td>', 'Sad that a marriage can become so bad that escape from it is a freedom. Lighting is a little harsh for my tastes.', '2004-07-15 12:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(812822, 90390, 3087, '<td valign="top">Sweet candid but background is much too cluttered with chopped off people - a lower DOF would have better isolated the subject.</td>', 'Sweet candid but background is much too cluttered with chopped off people - a lower DOF would have better isolated the subject.', '2004-07-15 12:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(812824, 90487, 3087, '<td valign="top">Boring at first glance but something about the composition is definitely pulling me back for a second look.</td>', 'Boring at first glance but something about the composition is definitely pulling me back for a second look.', '2004-07-15 12:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(812827, 90511, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice eye contact, straightforward image, though not very international in understanding since different books are on the banned list in different countries.</td>', 'Nice eye contact, straightforward image, though not very international in understanding since different books are on the banned list in different countries.', '2004-07-15 12:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(812831, 90161, 3087, '<td valign="top">Uneven lighting, uneven composition, bland content.</td>', 'Uneven lighting, uneven composition, bland content.', '2004-07-15 12:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(812832, 90024, 3087, '<td valign="top">Pretty but the boat is just too far to provide a sufficient focal point.</td>', 'Pretty but the boat is just too far to provide a sufficient focal point.', '2004-07-15 12:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(812833, 90354, 3087, '<td valign="top">Strong colours but the silhouette is just not interesting enough (for me).</td>', 'Strong colours but the silhouette is just not interesting enough (for me).', '2004-07-15 12:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(812836, 90036, 3087, '<td valign="top">I think wings open would convey the theme better. A little small within the frame for my preferences.</td>', 'I think wings open would convey the theme better. A little small within the frame for my preferences.', '2004-07-15 12:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(812837, 89904, 3087, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea and a way of getting round the no flags stipulation. Patriotism is never my cup of tea and doesn''t convey the concept well to me.</td>', 'An interesting idea and a way of getting round the no flags stipulation. Patriotism is never my cup of tea and doesn''t convey the concept well to me.', '2004-07-15 12:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(812838, 90567, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not an appealing expression nor an interesting background.</td>', 'Not an appealing expression nor an interesting background.', '2004-07-15 12:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(812839, 90105, 3087, '<td valign="top">Pretty butterfly image but somewhat bland or lacking in WOW factor.</td>', 'Pretty butterfly image but somewhat bland or lacking in WOW factor.', '2004-07-15 12:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(812842, 90219, 3087, '<td valign="top">Horizon tilted, picture quality seems low and silhouette detail just not very catchy.</td>', 'Horizon tilted, picture quality seems low and silhouette detail just not very catchy.', '2004-07-15 12:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(812843, 90566, 3087, '<td valign="top">Free love? Well I guess the instinctive (and probably joyless) mating of insects could be shoehorned into conveying that - but it''s a push for me...</td>', 'Free love? Well I guess the instinctive (and probably joyless) mating of insects could be shoehorned into conveying that - but it''s a push for me...', '2004-07-15 12:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(812961, 90483, 16829, '<td valign="top">Good Idea, too bad it couldn''t have been a balloon with a cotrasting color.</td>', 'Good Idea, too bad it couldn''t have been a balloon with a cotrasting color.', '2004-07-15 14:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(813013, 90480, 5746, '<td valign="top">That is great :))))<br/>Wonderful shot and a great sense of humor!</td>', 'That is great :))))Wonderful shot and a great sense of humor!', '2004-07-15 16:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(813017, 90577, 5746, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I wonder whether it realy is the cage?</td>', 'Nice idea. I wonder whether it realy is the cage?', '2004-07-15 16:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(813029, 89407, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a nice study but the lips should have been closed to complete its ecstatic mystique. yet it remains a strong image. I would have lowered the right thigh just a bit to remove its projectile look. Despite all of this it remains the best picture of the challenge.</td>', 'This is a nice study but the lips should have been closed to complete its ecstatic mystique. yet it remains a strong image. I would have lowered the right thigh just a bit to remove its projectile look. Despite all of this it remains the best picture of the challenge.', '2004-07-15 16:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(813037, 90580, 23999, '<td valign="top">I think this is að GREAT idea... I love it!</td>', 'I think this is að GREAT idea... I love it!', '2004-07-15 16:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(813055, 90487, 11895, '<td valign="top">the frame is a little overdone, gimmicky; other than that a nice shot</td>', 'the frame is a little overdone, gimmicky; other than that a nice shot', '2004-07-15 17:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(813062, 90580, 9731, '<td valign="top">I like this picture very much.  It´s 100% to the point. <br/>To gratulation with this very good picture.</td>', 'I like this picture very much.  It´s 100% to the point. To gratulation with this very good picture.', '2004-07-15 17:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(813078, 90207, 22659, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea. I just hope he can''t get the ring off.  Cheaters never prosper. lol Great job!</td>', 'Very clever idea. I just hope he can''t get the ring off.  Cheaters never prosper. lol Great job!', '2004-07-15 17:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(813080, 89534, 22659, '<td valign="top">Hey! I think I have been to this beach before. Nice shot.</td>', 'Hey! I think I have been to this beach before. Nice shot.', '2004-07-15 17:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(813082, 90361, 22659, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I love the colours in the stone!</td>', 'Very nice. I love the colours in the stone!', '2004-07-15 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(813086, 89407, 22659, '<td valign="top">Very pretty model :)</td>', 'Very pretty model :)', '2004-07-15 17:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(813114, 90250, 22659, '<td valign="top">Like the picture but not the title so much.</td>', 'Like the picture but not the title so much.', '2004-07-15 17:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(813122, 90583, 22659, '<td valign="top">Moooooooooo!  Great picture.</td>', 'Moooooooooo!  Great picture.', '2004-07-15 17:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(813129, 90568, 22659, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. Typo in the title?</td>', 'Nice picture. Typo in the title?', '2004-07-15 17:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(813133, 90413, 22659, '<td valign="top">That would be nice. Great ideat.</td>', 'That would be nice. Great ideat.', '2004-07-15 17:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(813138, 90356, 22659, '<td valign="top">lol Funny.</td>', 'lol Funny.', '2004-07-15 17:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(813144, 90577, 22659, '<td valign="top">I had the same idea but thought somebody else might be thinking the same thing. I am glad I didn''t now cause this is way better than I could have done.</td>', 'I had the same idea but thought somebody else might be thinking the same thing. I am glad I didn''t now cause this is way better than I could have done.', '2004-07-15 17:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(813170, 89991, 6130, '<td valign="top">Nice and I like the colors.</td>', 'Nice and I like the colors.', '2004-07-15 18:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(813181, 90452, 22659, '<td valign="top">Looks like a post card.</td>', 'Looks like a post card.', '2004-07-15 18:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(813184, 89226, 22659, '<td valign="top">If this is freedom, you can have it! I wouldn''t want to be caged up. Nice picture though.</td>', 'If this is freedom, you can have it! I wouldn''t want to be caged up. Nice picture though.', '2004-07-15 18:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(813185, 90387, 22659, '<td valign="top">Breath taking scenery.</td>', 'Breath taking scenery.', '2004-07-15 18:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(813190, 90569, 22659, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but who  is the one with the freedom though?</td>', 'Nice picture but who  is the one with the freedom though?', '2004-07-15 18:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(813195, 90036, 22659, '<td valign="top">Pictue would have been so much better with a nicer colour blue sky and some fluffy clouds. And the bird should not have been in the center of the picture.</td>', 'Pictue would have been so much better with a nicer colour blue sky and some fluffy clouds. And the bird should not have been in the center of the picture.', '2004-07-15 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(813233, 90446, 22659, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this much better with  a silver chain. Or even a black chain with a white background.  I think the yellow makes it look cheap like plastic. Good picture though.</td>', 'I would have liked this much better with  a silver chain. Or even a black chain with a white background.  I think the yellow makes it look cheap like plastic. Good picture though.', '2004-07-15 19:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(813235, 90161, 8860, '<td valign="top">Composition is a little awkward - too centered and bottom-heavy. Lighting''s OK and the contrast of the symbol is good.</td>', 'Composition is a little awkward - too centered and bottom-heavy. Lighting''s OK and the contrast of the symbol is good.', '2004-07-15 19:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(813275, 90207, 6202, '<td valign="top">LOL...cute idea for the challenge...looks like he needs a little soap to get that ring off</td>', 'LOL...cute idea for the challenge...looks like he needs a little soap to get that ring off', '2004-07-15 19:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(813278, 90452, 6202, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo, excellent placement of your subject.  10 from me.</td>', 'Fantastic photo, excellent placement of your subject.  10 from me.', '2004-07-15 20:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(813281, 90105, 6202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful butterfly.  Might want to think about cropping in slighly on the left side and more the butterfuly more into the outer third of the photo.8</td>', 'Beautiful butterfly.  Might want to think about cropping in slighly on the left side and more the butterfuly more into the outer third of the photo.8', '2004-07-15 20:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(813308, 90483, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great idea!! ;-) I wish there had been some clouds in the sky when I made my balloon shot. Although a bit bright here, they make the photo more interesting.</td>', 'Great idea!! ;-) I wish there had been some clouds in the sky when I made my balloon shot. Although a bit bright here, they make the photo more interesting.', '2004-07-15 20:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(813310, 90250, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great color and nice composition. I like the position of the clouds in relation to the bird.</td>', 'Great color and nice composition. I like the position of the clouds in relation to the bird.', '2004-07-15 21:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(813322, 90452, 10402, '<td valign="top">The high key approach is perfect here, and the model is just the right size compared to the vast ocean. The color seems a bit warm, but that may just be me.</td>', 'The high key approach is perfect here, and the model is just the right size compared to the vast ocean. The color seems a bit warm, but that may just be me.', '2004-07-15 21:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(813335, 90361, 10402, '<td valign="top">A technically difficult shot with such bright and dark areas (I don''t know if a polarizer would have helped), but nicely done. A great interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'A technically difficult shot with such bright and dark areas (I don''t know if a polarizer would have helped), but nicely done. A great interpretation of the challenge.', '2004-07-15 21:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(813340, 90568, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice approach to the challenge. I wish the girl on the left had an excited expression like the other one, which is wonderful. There is a color cast that reduces the contrast (and the impact).</td>', 'Nice approach to the challenge. I wish the girl on the left had an excited expression like the other one, which is wonderful. There is a color cast that reduces the contrast (and the impact).', '2004-07-15 21:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(813341, 90356, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great setup and composition. Needs better lighting.</td>', 'Great setup and composition. Needs better lighting.', '2004-07-15 21:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(813345, 90090, 10402, '<td valign="top">The clouds fit well with the statue, and the stark lighting works well here. The sharpness of the statue is great, really bringing out its texture. But sharpening has created some fringes where dark meets light. Try selecting the statue and contracting the selection by a few pixels before applying USM.</td>', 'The clouds fit well with the statue, and the stark lighting works well here. The sharpness of the statue is great, really bringing out its texture. But sharpening has created some fringes where dark meets light. Try selecting the statue and contracting the selection by a few pixels before applying USM.', '2004-07-15 21:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
