(814378, 90452, 16821, '<td valign="top">Nice Composition, &lt;== That was my first comment. Now I''ll tell you what I really think. I should have given it a 10, simply because, "Freedom, really is the ability, to be a Free spirit". Congratulations for a very expressive photograph. I like the tatoo, in fact it further shows the free spirit of the subject. The foamy surf looks nearly perfect in motion as does the water off her foot. The perfectly flat unobstructed horizon line again, doesn''t distract from the subject. The pastels blend very well. Congratulations!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-07-20 18:41:50.</i></td>', 'Nice Composition, <== That was my first comment. Now I''ll tell you what I really think. I should have given it a 10, simply because, "Freedom, really is the ability, to be a Free spirit". Congratulations for a very expressive photograph. I like the tatoo, in fact it further shows the free spirit of the subject. The foamy surf looks nearly perfect in motion as does the water off her foot. The perfectly flat unobstructed horizon line again, doesn''t distract from the subject. The pastels blend very well. Congratulations!', '2004-07-16 19:50:58.000000', '2004-07-20 19:41:50.000000', 1),
