(814581, 90163, 12611, '<td valign="top">THey should make a law about bad church design! Nice colors, blue- off white. The lighting makes you go right to where you want the eye to go. Great composition- this is a success- nice job.</td>', 'THey should make a law about bad church design! Nice colors, blue- off white. The lighting makes you go right to where you want the eye to go. Great composition- this is a success- nice job.', '2004-07-16 22:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
