(814586, 90245, 12611, '<td valign="top">"bird love" is my favorite topic. kudos. I love shots that "personify" animals to have human emotions. Dogs don''t have feelings, cats don;t cry when you call them fat.bird don;t really hug, until now.double kudos.</td>', '"bird love" is my favorite topic. kudos. I love shots that "personify" animals to have human emotions. Dogs don''t have feelings, cats don;t cry when you call them fat.bird don;t really hug, until now.double kudos.', '2004-07-16 23:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
