(814613, 90406, 11895, '<td valign="top">great idea but too much contrast for my taste, less would have given more definition to both the sky/water background and to the subject- the boat; also it would be better if you had rotated it so the horizon was leveled</td>', 'great idea but too much contrast for my taste, less would have given more definition to both the sky/water background and to the subject- the boat; also it would be better if you had rotated it so the horizon was leveled', '2004-07-16 23:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(814615, 90569, 23267, '<td valign="top">This is a glass of water away from perfection, (I think that''s what is filling the right quarter of the frame?).  It just pulls the eye away from the important components of the frame. An 8 anyway.</td>', 'This is a glass of water away from perfection, (I think that''s what is filling the right quarter of the frame?).  It just pulls the eye away from the important components of the frame. An 8 anyway.', '2004-07-16 23:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(814617, 90540, 23267, '<td valign="top">Maybe it was all you had left afer the divorce, but a nicer pen would have made this a really great photo. Good anyway, 7.</td>', 'Maybe it was all you had left afer the divorce, but a nicer pen would have made this a really great photo. Good anyway, 7.', '2004-07-16 23:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
