(814810, 90287, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice hippie type shot- I love the background. Maybe at sunrise or sunset there would be a better "warmth" and less snapshotty feel.</td>', 'Nice hippie type shot- I love the background. Maybe at sunrise or sunset there would be a better "warmth" and less snapshotty feel.', '2004-07-17 07:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(814811, 89826, 12611, '<td valign="top">This shot is Ok- I''m sure you have comments so I will just add that  I think your placement of the "hawk" or eagle-type bird of prey is nice. The extreme crop or digital zoom is not impressive.</td>', 'This shot is Ok- I''m sure you have comments so I will just add that  I think your placement of the "hawk" or eagle-type bird of prey is nice. The extreme crop or digital zoom is not impressive.', '2004-07-17 07:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(814812, 90107, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great contrast. I love that white shirt and the light in the back ground. I''ll have what this guy is having- and make it a double. I hope you gave this guy a couple-o-bucks for a pint of wild irish rose. its only fair.</td>', 'Great contrast. I love that white shirt and the light in the back ground. I''ll have what this guy is having- and make it a double. I hope you gave this guy a couple-o-bucks for a pint of wild irish rose. its only fair.', '2004-07-17 07:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(814813, 90413, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast, lighting, color and composition. This spells it all out for you. I would think about titleing this one "F-you money"</td>', 'Nice contrast, lighting, color and composition. This spells it all out for you. I would think about titleing this one "F-you money"', '2004-07-17 07:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(814814, 90310, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like teh movement of the drum banging. I alo think that even though this is not an "erotic" shot, the t-shirt does not enhance the shape of the model despite the semi-enthused come hither- stare.</td>', 'I like teh movement of the drum banging. I alo think that even though this is not an "erotic" shot, the t-shirt does not enhance the shape of the model despite the semi-enthused come hither- stare.', '2004-07-17 07:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(814816, 90348, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great lighting here. thats your strong point. there is some distracting grain in the eye socket, and  the the cheek is a bit digital looking, but the black contrast is nice. They say that where the darkest part of a photo or painting meets the lightest spot is often the focal point regardless of composition- if thats the case you have 3 focal points, nose, teeth, extreme left frame near bridge of eye. but my eye is drawn to the teeth in the front. <br/>I think you did a great job here and I like the fact that the focus is stronger on th e left that in the center. lastly, I hope you paid the model for this shot with a "get out of hell free card."</td>', 'Great lighting here. thats your strong point. there is some distracting grain in the eye socket, and  the the cheek is a bit digital looking, but the black contrast is nice. They say that where the darkest part of a photo or painting meets the lightest spot is often the focal point regardless of composition- if thats the case you have 3 focal points, nose, teeth, extreme left frame near bridge of eye. but my eye is drawn to the teeth in the front. I think you did a great job here and I like the fact that the focus is stronger on th e left that in the center. lastly, I hope you paid the model for this shot with a "get out of hell free card."', '2004-07-17 07:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(814817, 90583, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity here, but a few things distract me. first, the bull way back there is too sharp and in focus. looks unnatural and takes away from the real subject. I would sharpen this so much, and I would crop that annoying bush out on the left side blocking the bull that is grazing. I hope there was a fence in between you and the cattle.</td>', 'Nice clarity here, but a few things distract me. first, the bull way back there is too sharp and in focus. looks unnatural and takes away from the real subject. I would sharpen this so much, and I would crop that annoying bush out on the left side blocking the bull that is grazing. I hope there was a fence in between you and the cattle.', '2004-07-17 07:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(814818, 90360, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice rock formation. somehowe the horizon works dead center. Nicxe array of blues here. Its very relaxing shot.</td>', 'Nice rock formation. somehowe the horizon works dead center. Nicxe array of blues here. Its very relaxing shot.', '2004-07-17 07:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(814820, 89210, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and storytelling. Great contrast and warmth. Alternate title" The curmudgeon" Nice job, excellently done.</td>', 'Excellent composition and storytelling. Great contrast and warmth. Alternate title" The curmudgeon" Nice job, excellently done.', '2004-07-17 08:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(814821, 90516, 12611, '<td valign="top">Fantastic impressionist painting feel. Great colors, There is really not much wrong with this photograph. I like the overcast darkness of the shot. The blurry softness seems like a post processing effect, but its still awesome.</td>', 'Fantastic impressionist painting feel. Great colors, There is really not much wrong with this photograph. I like the overcast darkness of the shot. The blurry softness seems like a post processing effect, but its still awesome.', '2004-07-17 08:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(814822, 90507, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Very blue and still and  just right in the clouds. consider a title change to "Canons for Jesus"</td>', 'Nice composition. Very blue and still and  just right in the clouds. consider a title change to "Canons for Jesus"', '2004-07-17 08:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(814825, 90574, 12611, '<td valign="top">This has a great light. THe composition is a bit busy and under exposed in the foreground. But there is a beautiful light and redness to the trees. I would crop out a little sky and make this a giant poster,</td>', 'This has a great light. THe composition is a bit busy and under exposed in the foreground. But there is a beautiful light and redness to the trees. I would crop out a little sky and make this a giant poster,', '2004-07-17 08:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(814841, 90446, 24053, '<td valign="top">Nice simple idea</td>', 'Nice simple idea', '2004-07-17 09:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(814924, 90452, 14448, '<td valign="top">While several attempted this concept, yours is the one that succeeds.  Lovely desaturated colours.  I do find two elements of the image distracting - the dead center horizon line, and her tattoo; I would consider fixing by recropping and cloning.<br/>Technical 3/3<br/>Creative 2/3<br/>Conveys the Theme 3/3<br/>Je Ne Sais Quoi 0/1<br/> <br/>8/10</td>', 'While several attempted this concept, yours is the one that succeeds.  Lovely desaturated colours.  I do find two elements of the image distracting - the dead center horizon line, and her tattoo; I would consider fixing by recropping and cloning.Technical 3/3Creative 2/3Conveys the Theme 3/3Je Ne Sais Quoi 0/1 8/10', '2004-07-17 12:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(814929, 90135, 14448, '<td valign="top">One of the best of the competition.  Simple setup and composition wonderfully conveys the exhuberance of freedom.  Vivid, crisp, well controlled DoF.<br/>Technical: 3/3<br/>Creative: 2/3<br/>Conveys the Theme: 2.5/3<br/>Je Ne Sais Quoi: 0.5/1<br/> <br/>8/10</td>', 'One of the best of the competition.  Simple setup and composition wonderfully conveys the exhuberance of freedom.  Vivid, crisp, well controlled DoF.Technical: 3/3Creative: 2/3Conveys the Theme: 2.5/3Je Ne Sais Quoi: 0.5/1 8/10', '2004-07-17 12:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(814937, 90356, 14448, '<td valign="top">Simple, creative, funny.  Well done.<br/> <br/>Technical: 2.5/3 - crisp, well controlled DoF, a little dark<br/>Creative: 2.5/3<br/>Conveys the Theme: 3/3<br/>Je Ne Sais Quoi: 0/1<br/> <br/>8/10</td>', 'Simple, creative, funny.  Well done. Technical: 2.5/3 - crisp, well controlled DoF, a little darkCreative: 2.5/3Conveys the Theme: 3/3Je Ne Sais Quoi: 0/1 8/10', '2004-07-17 12:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(814938, 90569, 14448, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites of the competition.  Similar idea to my own submission, although done with a lot more subtlety and grace.  The handwritten "John" is a really nice touch!  Somewhat greater DoF might have been better, since everything but the rings is a little tricky to discern.  And I don''t think the glass adds anything to the impact - cropping everything to the right of his mouth could make it stronger.  In any case, well done.<br/>Technical 2.5/3<br/>Creative 2.5/3<br/>Conveys the Theme 3/3<br/>Je Ne Sais Quoi 1/1<br/>9/10<br/></td>', 'One of my favourites of the competition.  Similar idea to my own submission, although done with a lot more subtlety and grace.  The handwritten "John" is a really nice touch!  Somewhat greater DoF might have been better, since everything but the rings is a little tricky to discern.  And I don''t think the glass adds anything to the impact - cropping everything to the right of his mouth could make it stronger.  In any case, well done.Technical 2.5/3Creative 2.5/3Conveys the Theme 3/3Je Ne Sais Quoi 1/19/10', '2004-07-17 12:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(814940, 90580, 14448, '<td valign="top">This competition''s most creatively expressive illustration of the theme.  A couple of the other entries affect me more strongly, but overall this is near the top for me.<br/> <br/>Technical 2.5 - good tonal range, could be a little sharper, a little less grainy<br/>Creative 2.5 - basic but strong composition<br/>Conveys the Theme 3/3 - beautifully<br/>Je Ne Sais Quoi 0/1<br/> <br/>8/10</td>', 'This competition''s most creatively expressive illustration of the theme.  A couple of the other entries affect me more strongly, but overall this is near the top for me. Technical 2.5 - good tonal range, could be a little sharper, a little less grainyCreative 2.5 - basic but strong compositionConveys the Theme 3/3 - beautifullyJe Ne Sais Quoi 0/1 8/10', '2004-07-17 12:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(814952, 90486, 14448, '<td valign="top">Glorious colours.  Nicely composed.  Effectively conveys the sense of freedom.<br/> <br/>Technical: 2.5/3 -  shadows are a little dark; could be sharper<br/>Creative: 2.5/3<br/>Conveys the Theme: 2.5/3<br/>Je Ne Sais Quoi:0.5/1<br/> <br/>8/10</td>', 'Glorious colours.  Nicely composed.  Effectively conveys the sense of freedom. Technical: 2.5/3 -  shadows are a little dark; could be sharperCreative: 2.5/3Conveys the Theme: 2.5/3Je Ne Sais Quoi:0.5/1 8/10', '2004-07-17 12:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
