(815430, 90486, 2, '<td valign="top">I could see this image on the front of a stock photo site.  The sky color throws me off a bit, but I love the intense saturation.</td>', 'I could see this image on the front of a stock photo site.  The sky color throws me off a bit, but I love the intense saturation.', '2004-07-18 01:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(815431, 90394, 2, '<td valign="top">I feel like the weight of the image is just a little off -- like it either needs to be cropped tighter on the left side or allowed to stretch out past their shadows.  Good challenge entry.  Technically very well pulled-off.</td>', 'I feel like the weight of the image is just a little off -- like it either needs to be cropped tighter on the left side or allowed to stretch out past their shadows.  Good challenge entry.  Technically very well pulled-off.', '2004-07-18 01:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(815433, 90387, 2, '<td valign="top">I feel like the the subject/title is a bit of a stretch for challenge.  The photo itself is very intriguing, and I love the composition.</td>', 'I feel like the the subject/title is a bit of a stretch for challenge.  The photo itself is very intriguing, and I love the composition.', '2004-07-18 01:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(815434, 89973, 2, '<td valign="top">Difficult shot to pull off.  A very worthy try, and certainly a good interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Difficult shot to pull off.  A very worthy try, and certainly a good interpretation of the challenge.', '2004-07-18 01:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(815436, 90245, 2, '<td valign="top">I love the blacked-out background.  I''m sure you''ve heard this many times already, but I definitely feel this should be a centered composition.</td>', 'I love the blacked-out background.  I''m sure you''ve heard this many times already, but I definitely feel this should be a centered composition.', '2004-07-18 01:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(815437, 90090, 2, '<td valign="top">Great choice of subject.  Great angle.</td>', 'Great choice of subject.  Great angle.', '2004-07-18 01:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(815438, 90098, 2, '<td valign="top">Very powerful image.  Incredible tones.</td>', 'Very powerful image.  Incredible tones.', '2004-07-18 01:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(815439, 90410, 2, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting and powerful photograph -- one I wouldn''t be surprised to see in a political art show.  I love the dark, overcast tone.</td>', 'This is a really interesting and powerful photograph -- one I wouldn''t be surprised to see in a political art show.  I love the dark, overcast tone.', '2004-07-18 01:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(815440, 90361, 2, '<td valign="top">In order for me to buy this image as an escape, I think I have to feel trapped, but I don''t.  I also have trouble finding a focal point at which to start viewing this photograph.</td>', 'In order for me to buy this image as an escape, I think I have to feel trapped, but I don''t.  I also have trouble finding a focal point at which to start viewing this photograph.', '2004-07-18 01:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(815441, 90487, 2, '<td valign="top">I''m trying, but I just don''t buy this for freedom.  I also really dislike the border, as I don''t feel it adds anything to the composition and otherwise just doesn''t really make sense.</td>', 'I''m trying, but I just don''t buy this for freedom.  I also really dislike the border, as I don''t feel it adds anything to the composition and otherwise just doesn''t really make sense.', '2004-07-18 01:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(815442, 89878, 2, '<td valign="top">A very powerful image.  You lose me a bit on the left side, especially with what seems to me to be unnecessary space.  I feel like the lack of focus on the right side is enough of a negative (in the photographic sense, not the emotional one) composition without the space on the left.  I don''t entirely get the tape-like piece, but I can definitely give you the benefit of the doubt with the rest of this stunning composition.  The seemingly inexplicable color cast on the body is awesome and really adds another dimension to this photo.  All in all, a great challenge entry.</td>', 'A very powerful image.  You lose me a bit on the left side, especially with what seems to me to be unnecessary space.  I feel like the lack of focus on the right side is enough of a negative (in the photographic sense, not the emotional one) composition without the space on the left.  I don''t entirely get the tape-like piece, but I can definitely give you the benefit of the doubt with the rest of this stunning composition.  The seemingly inexplicable color cast on the body is awesome and really adds another dimension to this photo.  All in all, a great challenge entry.', '2004-07-18 01:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(815443, 90381, 2, '<td valign="top">This is too much of a stretch on the challenge topic.  The image quality is also distracting.</td>', 'This is too much of a stretch on the challenge topic.  The image quality is also distracting.', '2004-07-18 01:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(815444, 90353, 2, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  Wonderful colors.  Wonderful sense of distance.</td>', 'Great composition.  Wonderful colors.  Wonderful sense of distance.', '2004-07-18 02:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(815445, 90124, 2, '<td valign="top">This is frightening.  The little bit of grain on the image almost seems to me to be lack of resolution and not a photographic technique, but otherwise a very intriguing challenge entry.</td>', 'This is frightening.  The little bit of grain on the image almost seems to me to be lack of resolution and not a photographic technique, but otherwise a very intriguing challenge entry.', '2004-07-18 02:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(815446, 90191, 2, '<td valign="top">I''m definitely not into the border.  I like this much more as a painting than as a photograph, and so it seems like most of the weight is carried by some sort of plugin.  I could certainly be wrong, but that''s just what I get from the image.</td>', 'I''m definitely not into the border.  I like this much more as a painting than as a photograph, and so it seems like most of the weight is carried by some sort of plugin.  I could certainly be wrong, but that''s just what I get from the image.', '2004-07-18 02:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(815447, 90423, 2, '<td valign="top">I think if I want to buy that the subject is really relaxing and away from the struggles of life, I don''t want to be reminded that she has a dirty pool that needs taken care of.</td>', 'I think if I want to buy that the subject is really relaxing and away from the struggles of life, I don''t want to be reminded that she has a dirty pool that needs taken care of.', '2004-07-18 02:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
