(815973, 90361, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great colors on the left and top, not so much on the right. As the stairs are somewhat near center, I think may a little cropping on the right might improve the composition and place more emphasis on the great colors and textures on the left.</td>', 'Great colors on the left and top, not so much on the right. As the stairs are somewhat near center, I think may a little cropping on the right might improve the composition and place more emphasis on the great colors and textures on the left.', '2004-07-18 19:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(815975, 90461, 11653, '<td valign="top">great dof</td>', 'great dof', '2004-07-18 19:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(815977, 90405, 8891, '<td valign="top">Lovet he composition, colors, exposure.  Well seen and shot. Great.</td>', 'Lovet he composition, colors, exposure.  Well seen and shot. Great.', '2004-07-18 19:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(815978, 90219, 11653, '<td valign="top">I think the horizon should be straight</td>', 'I think the horizon should be straight', '2004-07-18 19:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(815980, 90507, 9232, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see this cropped just slightly tigher on the lefthand side.  The righthand edge is fine but since the canon is pointing off the right side of the image I think it might give more visual impact to crop the photo lower (with less sky) and tighter on the left.</td>', 'I would have liked to see this cropped just slightly tigher on the lefthand side.  The righthand edge is fine but since the canon is pointing off the right side of the image I think it might give more visual impact to crop the photo lower (with less sky) and tighter on the left.', '2004-07-18 19:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(815982, 90361, 11653, '<td valign="top">I like the texture details in the rocks esp. on the left side</td>', 'I like the texture details in the rocks esp. on the left side', '2004-07-18 19:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(815983, 90423, 8891, '<td valign="top">Fish net?  Great idea, well shot: perfect exposure and great focus. Only nit would have been to use a cleaner pool, but what are your going to do.  Excellent.</td>', 'Fish net?  Great idea, well shot: perfect exposure and great focus. Only nit would have been to use a cleaner pool, but what are your going to do.  Excellent.', '2004-07-18 19:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(815986, 90483, 11653, '<td valign="top">composition feels off to me---top heavy</td>', 'composition feels off to me---top heavy', '2004-07-18 19:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(815988, 90205, 8891, '<td valign="top">Extremely well shot.</td>', 'Extremely well shot.', '2004-07-18 19:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(815989, 90250, 11653, '<td valign="top">composition could be more interesting. Subject in the center does not work for me on this shot.</td>', 'composition could be more interesting. Subject in the center does not work for me on this shot.', '2004-07-18 19:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(815990, 90376, 11653, '<td valign="top">powerful image, like the use of b/w</td>', 'powerful image, like the use of b/w', '2004-07-18 19:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(815991, 90348, 11653, '<td valign="top">cropped a bit tight on the top. I think the entire eye hole should be seen</td>', 'cropped a bit tight on the top. I think the entire eye hole should be seen', '2004-07-18 19:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(815993, 90354, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great colors in the sky and fine silhouette.  I might have tried this with a vertical orientation and have less emphasis on the model and more and the great expanse of the sky.</td>', 'Great colors in the sky and fine silhouette.  I might have tried this with a vertical orientation and have less emphasis on the model and more and the great expanse of the sky.', '2004-07-18 19:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(816036, 89487, 8005, '<td valign="top">Yeah Baby!</td>', 'Yeah Baby!', '2004-07-18 21:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(816052, 90245, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a sweet picture...regardless...7</td>', 'This is a sweet picture...regardless...7', '2004-07-18 21:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(816056, 90526, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this shot, but there are a couple of things that IMHO could make it just a bit more powerful...a discernable body instead of the blackness, and making the diagonal just a bit more angled up on the right end (corner to corner).   The lightest parts of the jeans are a bit bright on the bottom right corner.  Good idea...:o)</td>', 'I like the idea of this shot, but there are a couple of things that IMHO could make it just a bit more powerful...a discernable body instead of the blackness, and making the diagonal just a bit more angled up on the right end (corner to corner).   The lightest parts of the jeans are a bit bright on the bottom right corner.  Good idea...:o)', '2004-07-18 21:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(816121, 90353, 18722, '<td valign="top">One of the many bondage photos of this challenge.<br/> <br/>However, if the strings were to breatk...</td>', 'One of the many bondage photos of this challenge. However, if the strings were to breatk...', '2004-07-18 23:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(816128, 90487, 18722, '<td valign="top">I bet you have never seen the animbated filem ''the Sword in the Stone''</td>', 'I bet you have never seen the animbated filem ''the Sword in the Stone''', '2004-07-18 23:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(816135, 90284, 18722, '<td valign="top">The technique is nicely done, but a water drop clinging to a leaf does not say freedom to me.  It''s possible actions are quite limited.</td>', 'The technique is nicely done, but a water drop clinging to a leaf does not say freedom to me.  It''s possible actions are quite limited.', '2004-07-18 23:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(816139, 90352, 18722, '<td valign="top">Bondage?<br/> <br/>The tone seems a bit dark.  Not the image itself, but I wish there was more light on the cuffs; as it is there is little detail in the lower set.</td>', 'Bondage? The tone seems a bit dark.  Not the image itself, but I wish there was more light on the cuffs; as it is there is little detail in the lower set.', '2004-07-18 23:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(816140, 90283, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nice title, but the image needs a larger DOF.</td>', 'Nice title, but the image needs a larger DOF.', '2004-07-18 23:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(816144, 90353, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent image.  I think ''freedom'' is well defined here and the composition is excellent.</td>', 'This is an excellent image.  I think ''freedom'' is well defined here and the composition is excellent.', '2004-07-18 23:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(816145, 90406, 772, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo... i love it :)</td>', 'Gorgeous photo... i love it :)', '2004-07-18 23:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(816146, 90111, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I think it would have been a better image without the selective desat.  As it is, the selective color does not fit with your title.  The image is saying, "Kiss the flower", or something like that.</td>', 'Nicely done.  I think it would have been a better image without the selective desat.  As it is, the selective color does not fit with your title.  The image is saying, "Kiss the flower", or something like that.', '2004-07-18 23:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(816148, 90580, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this is probably my favorite photo in this challenge.  Freedom is a concept that is destroyed by time.  Your photo probably illustrates the purest form of freedom I have seen this week.  When time is NOT of the essence, freedom is strong.  Great shot and excellent thinking... = 10</td>', 'I think this is probably my favorite photo in this challenge.  Freedom is a concept that is destroyed by time.  Your photo probably illustrates the purest form of freedom I have seen this week.  When time is NOT of the essence, freedom is strong.  Great shot and excellent thinking... = 10', '2004-07-18 23:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(816152, 90376, 18722, '<td valign="top">Bondage?<br/> <br/>If you are expressing something, it is lost on me.</td>', 'Bondage? If you are expressing something, it is lost on me.', '2004-07-18 23:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(816154, 90416, 18722, '<td valign="top">Remote control shutter or really long timer?  :)<br/> <br/>The image seems quite flat.</td>', 'Remote control shutter or really long timer?  :) The image seems quite flat.', '2004-07-18 23:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(816156, 90245, 18722, '<td valign="top">The lighting is harsh, but not much you could have done about that.</td>', 'The lighting is harsh, but not much you could have done about that.', '2004-07-18 23:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(816157, 90213, 18722, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been better with her on the other side of the bars, hanging off and looking into the distance.  This has too many bars around her.</td>', 'I think it would have been better with her on the other side of the bars, hanging off and looking into the distance.  This has too many bars around her.', '2004-07-18 23:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(816158, 90488, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasts, beautiful bike, but that bend (from the lense?) makes it very wierd looking,</td>', 'Nice contrasts, beautiful bike, but that bend (from the lense?) makes it very wierd looking,', '2004-07-18 23:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(816160, 90577, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice story telling.  I like the open sky as a background and the suggestion of a bird with the feathers.  Maybe a little motion blur inthe feathers would make it a bit more exciting?</td>', 'Nice story telling.  I like the open sky as a background and the suggestion of a bird with the feathers.  Maybe a little motion blur inthe feathers would make it a bit more exciting?', '2004-07-18 23:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(816162, 88927, 7628, '<td valign="top">That is an amazing eye.  I love the flecks of pollen everywhere.  Wish the backgound were darker to contradct with the bright petals.  Good detail on the bee.</td>', 'That is an amazing eye.  I love the flecks of pollen everywhere.  Wish the backgound were darker to contradct with the bright petals.  Good detail on the bee.', '2004-07-18 23:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(816163, 90416, 7628, '<td valign="top">All the space around the plane does give an feel of freedom, but it makes it a bit uninteresting to look at - perhaps burning the clouds a little, creating some more drama?</td>', 'All the space around the plane does give an feel of freedom, but it makes it a bit uninteresting to look at - perhaps burning the clouds a little, creating some more drama?', '2004-07-18 23:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(816167, 90540, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and simple.  Nice composition of the words in the background both for meaning and filling the space.</td>', 'Very crisp and simple.  Nice composition of the words in the background both for meaning and filling the space.', '2004-07-18 23:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(816170, 90565, 7628, '<td valign="top">Lovely boats with their masts pointing up to the sky.  I wish the bridge weren''t there in the background distracting the eye.  I would also wonder how it would look with the horizon not straight through the middle?</td>', 'Lovely boats with their masts pointing up to the sky.  I wish the bridge weren''t there in the background distracting the eye.  I would also wonder how it would look with the horizon not straight through the middle?', '2004-07-18 23:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(816173, 90426, 7628, '<td valign="top">This looks like Vermont.  I like the range of blues and the texture of the mountains, the shade and sun on the green trees - this is a pictures I''d enjoy looking at every day! 9</td>', 'This looks like Vermont.  I like the range of blues and the texture of the mountains, the shade and sun on the green trees - this is a pictures I''d enjoy looking at every day! 9', '2004-07-18 23:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(816176, 90432, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like how the curveof the road leads your eye into the frame.    The green of the trees feels a little dry somehow, and the road a bit bright in the foreground.  I like that could looming behind the trees.</td>', 'I like how the curveof the road leads your eye into the frame.    The green of the trees feels a little dry somehow, and the road a bit bright in the foreground.  I like that could looming behind the trees.', '2004-07-18 23:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(816178, 90540, 18722, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I do not see the destruction of something that was once precious as an act of freedom.</td>', 'Sorry, but I do not see the destruction of something that was once precious as an act of freedom.', '2004-07-18 23:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(816183, 90314, 7628, '<td valign="top">Some nice detail on this moth.  Wish the setting were more either interesting or less distracting.  The lines of the plate keep drawing my eyes away.</td>', 'Some nice detail on this moth.  Wish the setting were more either interesting or less distracting.  The lines of the plate keep drawing my eyes away.', '2004-07-18 23:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(816185, 90024, 18722, '<td valign="top">...and into a storm it would appear.</td>', '...and into a storm it would appear.', '2004-07-18 23:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(816187, 90112, 18722, '<td valign="top">it is nice to spend some quite time alone, isn''t it.</td>', 'it is nice to spend some quite time alone, isn''t it.', '2004-07-18 23:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(816189, 89878, 7628, '<td valign="top">Dramatic and unusaul.  I like the red white and blue tones.  I like the unbalanced composition - thatin itself gives a confrontational feel which emphasizes the gesture.  I might have taken the glasses off.  Wish the "red side" of the face was as sharp as the "blue" - same goes for the chest - If you could have had the hand be out of focus because of a narrow depth of focus that would have been better than blurring it. 7</td>', 'Dramatic and unusaul.  I like the red white and blue tones.  I like the unbalanced composition - thatin itself gives a confrontational feel which emphasizes the gesture.  I might have taken the glasses off.  Wish the "red side" of the face was as sharp as the "blue" - same goes for the chest - If you could have had the hand be out of focus because of a narrow depth of focus that would have been better than blurring it. 7', '2004-07-18 23:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(816193, 90199, 7628, '<td valign="top">Lovely sunset.  The clouds do have some strange artifacts in them - from processing?  The silouettes of the people are sharp but the sunset is not -  Perhaps a greater depth of focus would have helped.</td>', 'Lovely sunset.  The clouds do have some strange artifacts in them - from processing?  The silouettes of the people are sharp but the sunset is not -  Perhaps a greater depth of focus would have helped.', '2004-07-18 23:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(816195, 90339, 7628, '<td valign="top">Good motion stop.  I like the little red feet on the left hand bird!  I like the details you got on the wings.  Perhaps darkenning the backgound a bit would make these pigeons pop out even more.  The composition with all that grass is a bit dull, perhaps a tighter crop to focus attention on the birds more?</td>', 'Good motion stop.  I like the little red feet on the left hand bird!  I like the details you got on the wings.  Perhaps darkenning the backgound a bit would make these pigeons pop out even more.  The composition with all that grass is a bit dull, perhaps a tighter crop to focus attention on the birds more?', '2004-07-18 23:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(816199, 90452, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is very playful, but subtle with its muted pastel colors.  I love the peacful gray/blue of the ocean and the sky, and the swinging pink of her top and her arms spread wide.  Simple, sweet, a favorite of mine this challenge.</td>', 'This is very playful, but subtle with its muted pastel colors.  I love the peacful gray/blue of the ocean and the sky, and the swinging pink of her top and her arms spread wide.  Simple, sweet, a favorite of mine this challenge.', '2004-07-18 23:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(816201, 90413, 18722, '<td valign="top">So, did you really when the $28 Million?</td>', 'So, did you really when the $28 Million?', '2004-07-18 23:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(816202, 90526, 7628, '<td valign="top">Different.  I like the texture and the faded yet hicg contrast look. It is an elegant abstract as well as a litteral picture. 9</td>', 'Different.  I like the texture and the faded yet hicg contrast look. It is an elegant abstract as well as a litteral picture. 9', '2004-07-18 23:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(816205, 90583, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of the pictures - all the way back into those trees.  Your one bright Cow in the forground marks a place for your eye to start looking until it wanders back to the cow in amoung the trees.  I like the framing fringe of long grass at the bottom.</td>', 'I like the depth of the pictures - all the way back into those trees.  Your one bright Cow in the forground marks a place for your eye to start looking until it wanders back to the cow in amoung the trees.  I like the framing fringe of long grass at the bottom.', '2004-07-19 00:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(816207, 90124, 18722, '<td valign="top">Bondage?  Sorry, does not say freedom to me.</td>', 'Bondage?  Sorry, does not say freedom to me.', '2004-07-19 00:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(816209, 90454, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the details in the metal - all those little scratches.  The lighting is as interesting idea  - the colors I mean.  But it is a bit dark for my taste - the "blue" top of the key gets lost in the darkness.</td>', 'I like the details in the metal - all those little scratches.  The lighting is as interesting idea  - the colors I mean.  But it is a bit dark for my taste - the "blue" top of the key gets lost in the darkness.', '2004-07-19 00:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(816212, 90341, 18722, '<td valign="top">You get a humor point, but loose 2 for the DOF being too shallow.</td>', 'You get a humor point, but loose 2 for the DOF being too shallow.', '2004-07-19 00:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(816215, 90569, 18722, '<td valign="top">The destruction of that which was once treasured does not express freedom to me.</td>', 'The destruction of that which was once treasured does not express freedom to me.', '2004-07-19 00:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(816218, 90377, 7628, '<td valign="top">The brightness of the girl contrasts well with the dark sculpture - light and living, dark, heavy metal,  The splashing water picks up the highlights of her hair.  But the backgrouns is so busy that the girl is a bit lost as the main subject.  You could crop down from the top.  Wish the focus on the girl was a bit sharper too.</td>', 'The brightness of the girl contrasts well with the dark sculpture - light and living, dark, heavy metal,  The splashing water picks up the highlights of her hair.  But the backgrouns is so busy that the girl is a bit lost as the main subject.  You could crop down from the top.  Wish the focus on the girl was a bit sharper too.', '2004-07-19 00:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(816219, 89917, 18722, '<td valign="top">He does not seem free, but burdoned by heavy burdons.</td>', 'He does not seem free, but burdoned by heavy burdons.', '2004-07-19 00:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(816222, 90335, 18722, '<td valign="top">Free of constraint, yes indeed ... or is it.  Trapped within the wind, with no means to guide its own destiny.</td>', 'Free of constraint, yes indeed ... or is it.  Trapped within the wind, with no means to guide its own destiny.', '2004-07-19 00:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(816225, 90144, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the idea - the silouette of the cat against the curtains. The bits of light peeking through.  Perhaps cropping would bring the subject more into focus (figureatively)  I''d crop the right hand side out at the division of the window leaving the height of the picture the same, curtains towersing above the cat, as (s)he longingly gazes at the forbidden world outside.  Yeah, I have cats.</td>', 'I like the idea - the silouette of the cat against the curtains. The bits of light peeking through.  Perhaps cropping would bring the subject more into focus (figureatively)  I''d crop the right hand side out at the division of the window leaving the height of the picture the same, curtains towersing above the cat, as (s)he longingly gazes at the forbidden world outside.  Yeah, I have cats.', '2004-07-19 00:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(816227, 89878, 18722, '<td valign="top">Another anti-thesis photo...</td>', 'Another anti-thesis photo...', '2004-07-19 00:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(816228, 90526, 18722, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the black does nothing for me.  White or a warm body in being freed would have expressed the concept better.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the black does nothing for me.  White or a warm body in being freed would have expressed the concept better.', '2004-07-19 00:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(816229, 90208, 18722, '<td valign="top">The destruction of that which was once viewed as precious does not convey freedom to me.</td>', 'The destruction of that which was once viewed as precious does not convey freedom to me.', '2004-07-19 00:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(816238, 90403, 18722, '<td valign="top">Another anti-thesis photo ... does not convey freedom to me.</td>', 'Another anti-thesis photo ... does not convey freedom to me.', '2004-07-19 00:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(816240, 90500, 7628, '<td valign="top">It is terrifis how you got detail in both the bright hand and the dark concrete.  I like the absolute blackness of the hole, and the added touch of the ring on the hand.  This picture tells a interesting story - creeoy but intriguing. 9</td>', 'It is terrifis how you got detail in both the bright hand and the dark concrete.  I like the absolute blackness of the hole, and the added touch of the ring on the hand.  This picture tells a interesting story - creeoy but intriguing. 9', '2004-07-19 00:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(816241, 90528, 18722, '<td valign="top">You win a humor vote and one for originality.</td>', 'You win a humor vote and one for originality.', '2004-07-19 00:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(816242, 90356, 23454, '<td valign="top">Great picture!! The composition is superb. This is my top pick! It definitely says "FREEDOM". 10</td>', 'Great picture!! The composition is superb. This is my top pick! It definitely says "FREEDOM". 10', '2004-07-19 00:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(816243, 90111, 7628, '<td valign="top">Elegant.  Nice color and composition.  The color makes the connection between the lips (petals of a type) and the flower.</td>', 'Elegant.  Nice color and composition.  The color makes the connection between the lips (petals of a type) and the flower.', '2004-07-19 00:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(816244, 90381, 18722, '<td valign="top">Why the 180 degree rotate?</td>', 'Why the 180 degree rotate?', '2004-07-19 00:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(816247, 89226, 18722, '<td valign="top">Bondage?  Sorry, this does not express freedom to me.</td>', 'Bondage?  Sorry, this does not express freedom to me.', '2004-07-19 00:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(816248, 90308, 7628, '<td valign="top">The hay and the scene would have been enough for a lovely photo, but the fox really makes it wonderful.  I like the mistiness of the backgound and the sharpness of the foreground.</td>', 'The hay and the scene would have been enough for a lovely photo, but the fox really makes it wonderful.  I like the mistiness of the backgound and the sharpness of the foreground.', '2004-07-19 00:19:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(816250, 89830, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nice image, even from someone who views sleep as a prison I am condemned to 6 hrs a night.</td>', 'Nice image, even from someone who views sleep as a prison I am condemned to 6 hrs a night.', '2004-07-19 00:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(816254, 90144, 18722, '<td valign="top">Bondage?  Sorry, but I agree you were reaching.</td>', 'Bondage?  Sorry, but I agree you were reaching.', '2004-07-19 00:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(816256, 90207, 18722, '<td valign="top">Looks more like he is entering into a prison of self-loathing.</td>', 'Looks more like he is entering into a prison of self-loathing.', '2004-07-19 00:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(816258, 90433, 1054, '<td valign="top">My favorite photographs are those that tell the viewer something beyond what''s in the frame. This shot is one of the. I''m sure you''re getting hammered but I love the blur and the grain. It really makes this shot. The composition is excellent. 10.</td>', 'My favorite photographs are those that tell the viewer something beyond what''s in the frame. This shot is one of the. I''m sure you''re getting hammered but I love the blur and the grain. It really makes this shot. The composition is excellent. 10.', '2004-07-19 00:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(816262, 90526, 18933, '<td valign="top">made me want to see what was missing in the black.......</td>', 'made me want to see what was missing in the black.......', '2004-07-19 00:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(816270, 90500, 1054, '<td valign="top">9... I think the only thing keeping me from giving tyhis a 10 is the ring... I feel like it shouldn''t be there.</td>', '9... I think the only thing keeping me from giving tyhis a 10 is the ring... I feel like it shouldn''t be there.', '2004-07-19 00:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(816272, 90452, 18933, '<td valign="top">very well composed</td>', 'very well composed', '2004-07-19 00:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(816277, 90565, 22734, '<td valign="top">I sail. I relate to this...</td>', 'I sail. I relate to this...', '2004-07-19 00:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(816282, 90483, 18722, '<td valign="top">Free from confinement, but still at the whims of the wind, with no ability to decide for itself.</td>', 'Free from confinement, but still at the whims of the wind, with no ability to decide for itself.', '2004-07-19 00:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(816283, 89830, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a very warm shot. Not sure about the premise but hey, it is so good you got my 7</td>', 'This is a very warm shot. Not sure about the premise but hey, it is so good you got my 7', '2004-07-19 00:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(816287, 88913, 18722, '<td valign="top">Another anit-thesis photo.  Sorry, but this does not say freedom to me.</td>', 'Another anit-thesis photo.  Sorry, but this does not say freedom to me.', '2004-07-19 00:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
