(816366, 90205, 22734, '<td valign="top">To those that got it, thank you. <br/>About this picture: First, I did not want to introduce a sexy looking picture, because it takes away from the the message. I then selected a foreshortening angle combined with closed legs at the bottom to change the look of the mass. I then created a layer, GB and worked the edges to remove firmness. I even changed the shadow values very slightly to give the rear a softer look. Out of this layer I erased the juncture of the buttocks. I then played with the channels to augment skin imperfections. I even burned the hands around the joints and knuckles. yes, I got carried away. Well, at the end it was a nude butt, but not overpowering as a sexual image. Shoot me.</td>', 'To those that got it, thank you. About this picture: First, I did not want to introduce a sexy looking picture, because it takes away from the the message. I then selected a foreshortening angle combined with closed legs at the bottom to change the look of the mass. I then created a layer, GB and worked the edges to remove firmness. I even changed the shadow values very slightly to give the rear a softer look. Out of this layer I erased the juncture of the buttocks. I then played with the channels to augment skin imperfections. I even burned the hands around the joints and knuckles. yes, I got carried away. Well, at the end it was a nude butt, but not overpowering as a sexual image. Shoot me.', '2004-07-19 01:10:25.000000', NULL, 0),
