(816432, 90580, 18722, '<td valign="top">Thank you for your exceptionally positive comments.<br/> <br/>I knew I liked this shot, but it is really nice to see that I was able to communicate the concept as well as I did.  It was not perfectly executed, as several of you pointed out, so I know where I need to work on the execution of the communication.<br/> <br/>A special thank you to those who have chosen this as a favorite.  You are my first.<br/> <br/>I was hoping to make the top 25%, but 12th is more than I had hoped for.<br/> <br/>David</td>', 'Thank you for your exceptionally positive comments. I knew I liked this shot, but it is really nice to see that I was able to communicate the concept as well as I did.  It was not perfectly executed, as several of you pointed out, so I know where I need to work on the execution of the communication. A special thank you to those who have chosen this as a favorite.  You are my first. I was hoping to make the top 25%, but 12th is more than I had hoped for. David', '2004-07-19 01:33:15.000000', NULL, 0),
