(820398, 90353, 2741, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by redfusion:</b></div><hr/><i> the clouds look fake, i dont see the freedom in flying a kite </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Clouds look fake??  They look real to me. You can easily get that effect by using a polarizer.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by redfusion: the clouds look fake, i dont see the freedom in flying a kite   Clouds look fake??  They look real to me. You can easily get that effect by using a polarizer. ', '2004-07-21 15:06:10.000000', NULL, 0),
